(762048, 83565, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is great! 2/3 ... and especially that you took it in a busy intersection.  It is very different.  Wouldn''t it be great if you''ve taken it near the Orange line?  Anyway, good capture!</td>', 'This is great! 2/3 ... and especially that you took it in a busy intersection.  It is very different.  Wouldn''t it be great if you''ve taken it near the Orange line?  Anyway, good capture!', '2004-06-14 01:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(762052, 83559, 20210, '<td valign="top">Yeah, yeah, Michael wins again, so what''s new? ;-)  My Williams team was DQ''ed after the race.  Outrageous!  This is a good pic, but a little washed out in the bright sun.  And I wish we could see a little more of the car in profile.  Amazing vehicles they are indeed.  Good luck with the shot!</td>', 'Yeah, yeah, Michael wins again, so what''s new? ;-)  My Williams team was DQ''ed after the race.  Outrageous!  This is a good pic, but a little washed out in the bright sun.  And I wish we could see a little more of the car in profile.  Amazing vehicles they are indeed.  Good luck with the shot!', '2004-06-14 01:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(762059, 83493, 20210, '<td valign="top">great pan of this beautiful car.  On a tripod?  An excellent capture.  One of the best panned shots in the challenge.</td>', 'great pan of this beautiful car.  On a tripod?  An excellent capture.  One of the best panned shots in the challenge.', '2004-06-14 01:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
