(762343, 83015, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this shot as the windows naturally frame the 2 points of subject. However, the lighting on the bottom left seems a bit distracting as the forground is caught in the middle between being a sillouhette, and just being underexposed. Maybe the use of flash or selective levels adjustment in photoshop would have helped? Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the composition on this shot as the windows naturally frame the 2 points of subject. However, the lighting on the bottom left seems a bit distracting as the forground is caught in the middle between being a sillouhette, and just being underexposed. Maybe the use of flash or selective levels adjustment in photoshop would have helped? Nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-06-14 04:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(762344, 83555, 15407, '<td valign="top">This is too cute!  ONe of those shots that you have to take. I''ve been wondering where I''ld like to pose this to compliment it''s ''features'' !</td>', 'This is too cute!  ONe of those shots that you have to take. I''ve been wondering where I''ld like to pose this to compliment it''s ''features'' !', '2004-06-14 04:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(762345, 83429, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition and contrast. The high-altitude cirrus clouds really emphasize the feeling of flight that this photo evokes. I found the small bit of cloud near the bottom left is somewhat distracting. But still a great shot.</td>', 'Good composition and contrast. The high-altitude cirrus clouds really emphasize the feeling of flight that this photo evokes. I found the small bit of cloud near the bottom left is somewhat distracting. But still a great shot.', '2004-06-14 04:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(762346, 83493, 15407, '<td valign="top">You''ve done an excellent job with this picture!  It''s all about the Lambo... it jumps right out of the picture... and the backdrop whatever it was compliments the colors and shape of the car!</td>', 'You''ve done an excellent job with this picture!  It''s all about the Lambo... it jumps right out of the picture... and the backdrop whatever it was compliments the colors and shape of the car!', '2004-06-14 04:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(762347, 83442, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good subject. The lines in the car cover''s fabric and natural shape of the rear-view mirror really draw the eye across the photo. Lighting and composition is nice too.</td>', 'Good subject. The lines in the car cover''s fabric and natural shape of the rear-view mirror really draw the eye across the photo. Lighting and composition is nice too.', '2004-06-14 04:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(762350, 83398, 15407, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting effect where the flash ''pushed'' some of the ''flare'' onto the  bumper &amp; chrome trim on the dark side of the car.</td>', 'That''s an interesting effect where the flash ''pushed'' some of the ''flare'' onto the  bumper & chrome trim on the dark side of the car.', '2004-06-14 04:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(762351, 83425, 15407, '<td valign="top">A shame about the "E Olde" building... great composistion, you placed your self very well to take the photo.</td>', 'A shame about the "E Olde" building... great composistion, you placed your self very well to take the photo.', '2004-06-14 04:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(762355, 83452, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - aerobatics capture is a challenge - pity you couldn''t get the sun behind you!</td>', 'Nice capture - aerobatics capture is a challenge - pity you couldn''t get the sun behind you!', '2004-06-14 05:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(762356, 83559, 15407, '<td valign="top">Undoubtledy the best 2 subjects in Automobile racing of all time!  The picture looks a bit pale and over sharpened to me.  Its not easy to get the focus sharp with a F1 car coming towards you.  The bright light should have produced an opportunity to shoot a very fast shutter speed with a reasonable Fstop to maximize the focus with a longer lens.  I think I would have started with something like a 4000th of a second at f16. I look forward to seeing the shooting data on this shot.shake.</td>', 'Undoubtledy the best 2 subjects in Automobile racing of all time!  The picture looks a bit pale and over sharpened to me.  Its not easy to get the focus sharp with a F1 car coming towards you.  The bright light should have produced an opportunity to shoot a very fast shutter speed with a reasonable Fstop to maximize the focus with a longer lens.  I think I would have started with something like a 4000th of a second at f16. I look forward to seeing the shooting data on this shot.shake.', '2004-06-14 05:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(762358, 83477, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - must have been a still day.</td>', 'Nice shot - must have been a still day.', '2004-06-14 05:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
