(762367, 83434, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant idea very nicely executed.  In an ideal world, it might have been better with a bit more light on the front of the van and the model.  I had a little play with ADOBE PS CS image/adjustments/shadow/highlight but maybe yours is better. . .   My highest score anyway!</td>', 'This is a brilliant idea very nicely executed.  In an ideal world, it might have been better with a bit more light on the front of the van and the model.  I had a little play with ADOBE PS CS image/adjustments/shadow/highlight but maybe yours is better. . .   My highest score anyway!', '2004-06-14 05:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
