(762524, 83536, 20210, '<td valign="top">The vigenetting works for this photo style, but I think it''s a bit too prevalent.  I kind of like the soft focus look on it, and the steam is great.</td>', 'The vigenetting works for this photo style, but I think it''s a bit too prevalent.  I kind of like the soft focus look on it, and the steam is great.', '2004-06-14 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(762534, 83587, 16004, '<td valign="top">This has some very nice touches; particular favourite aspects include the sky reflected in the windows, and the earthy yellows, greens and browns of the environment contrasting with the more urban look of the car.  personally, i might have stepped closer to the car and taken the shot / crop in a landscaped orientation (to me the top half of the sky is a bit redundant and samey - better to focus on all the action in the bottom half of the sky).  overall quite appealing.  7.</td>', 'This has some very nice touches; particular favourite aspects include the sky reflected in the windows, and the earthy yellows, greens and browns of the environment contrasting with the more urban look of the car.  personally, i might have stepped closer to the car and taken the shot / crop in a landscaped orientation (to me the top half of the sky is a bit redundant and samey - better to focus on all the action in the bottom half of the sky).  overall quite appealing.  7.', '2004-06-14 09:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(762537, 83356, 16004, '<td valign="top">great shot, brilliant conveyance of speed, and well done you for keeping the car in such pristine focus.  must have been a right bugger to get right, or at least it would have been for me.  10.</td>', 'great shot, brilliant conveyance of speed, and well done you for keeping the car in such pristine focus.  must have been a right bugger to get right, or at least it would have been for me.  10.', '2004-06-14 09:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(762539, 82976, 16004, '<td valign="top">ignoring the fact that i don''t really see this being a P,T, or A (it''s not even transport really, more plant) i would consider this a really decent shot.  considering you''ve chosen a diggers less interesting end (its bum) you''ve managed to give it a certain degree of style, probably helped with the correct decision to be B&amp;W.  However, the top of the cab looks a bit odd (band of darkness) and i think you might''ve cropped just a bit too much off the right.  still, nice photo. 7.</td>', 'ignoring the fact that i don''t really see this being a P,T, or A (it''s not even transport really, more plant) i would consider this a really decent shot.  considering you''ve chosen a diggers less interesting end (its bum) you''ve managed to give it a certain degree of style, probably helped with the correct decision to be B&W.  However, the top of the cab looks a bit odd (band of darkness) and i think you might''ve cropped just a bit too much off the right.  still, nice photo. 7.', '2004-06-14 10:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
