(762565, 83604, 16004, '<td valign="top">very very nice.  i love side-on shots of cars, and this chummy, is a great example and brilliant choice of subject matter.  the blue of the gorgeous car is wonderful, and i also love your choice of background.  only reservation i have is that the ends of the whatever-it-is (caddy?) is a bit close to the sides of the frame.  that aside, i think it''s well composed and very lovely to look at.  8.</td>', 'very very nice.  i love side-on shots of cars, and this chummy, is a great example and brilliant choice of subject matter.  the blue of the gorgeous car is wonderful, and i also love your choice of background.  only reservation i have is that the ends of the whatever-it-is (caddy?) is a bit close to the sides of the frame.  that aside, i think it''s well composed and very lovely to look at.  8.', '2004-06-14 10:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
