(762886, 83459, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great focus and subject on this photo. The background details of the buildings against those on the train are a little too busy though. Maybe some selective desaturation of the of the background to emphasize the subject? Or a lower angle (camera placed near the ground) my have helped to rienforce the scale of the train and eliminate some of the buildings from view? Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great focus and subject on this photo. The background details of the buildings against those on the train are a little too busy though. Maybe some selective desaturation of the of the background to emphasize the subject? Or a lower angle (camera placed near the ground) my have helped to rienforce the scale of the train and eliminate some of the buildings from view? Nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-06-14 15:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(762889, 83452, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition and contrast. The sky appears to be slightly grainy which detracts from the shot imho.</td>', 'Good composition and contrast. The sky appears to be slightly grainy which detracts from the shot imho.', '2004-06-14 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(762892, 83434, 22387, '<td valign="top">Wow... All you need is a train and you have it coverd :)</td>', 'Wow... All you need is a train and you have it coverd :)', '2004-06-14 15:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(762896, 83602, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and contrast throughout. The subject is very interesting, but seems to be shot in a rather mundane configuration imho.</td>', 'Nice colors and contrast throughout. The subject is very interesting, but seems to be shot in a rather mundane configuration imho.', '2004-06-14 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(762897, 83614, 22387, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the times....</td>', 'Great shot for the times....', '2004-06-14 15:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(762898, 83168, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of b&amp;w. I like how the reflective properties of the statues bring out just enough lines to creat the sillouhettes.</td>', 'Good composition and use of b&w. I like how the reflective properties of the statues bring out just enough lines to creat the sillouhettes.', '2004-06-14 15:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(762901, 83553, 22387, '<td valign="top">Very nice... love the checkerd flad in the background.... the photo keeps you looking for more stuff... great angle</td>', 'Very nice... love the checkerd flad in the background.... the photo keeps you looking for more stuff... great angle', '2004-06-14 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(762906, 82724, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot and vantage point you have there. This photo would be a plane-spotters dream. Good details on the aircraft''s undercarriage, slats, flaps, and reflections on the fuselage. The small traces of clouds to the right of the cockpit were a little distracting imho from an otherwise clean sillouhette. But nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great shot and vantage point you have there. This photo would be a plane-spotters dream. Good details on the aircraft''s undercarriage, slats, flaps, and reflections on the fuselage. The small traces of clouds to the right of the cockpit were a little distracting imho from an otherwise clean sillouhette. But nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-06-14 15:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(762907, 83501, 22387, '<td valign="top">Sweet.... got i miss the older cars</td>', 'Sweet.... got i miss the older cars', '2004-06-14 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(762909, 83434, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great juxtoposition of subjects here. The lighting and low POV on this shot works well.</td>', 'Great juxtoposition of subjects here. The lighting and low POV on this shot works well.', '2004-06-14 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(762912, 83473, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the character on the mans face here. The b&amp;w also works well. Good contrast between the subject and background.</td>', 'I love the character on the mans face here. The b&w also works well. Good contrast between the subject and background.', '2004-06-14 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(762915, 83241, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture. The resulting contrasts of the reflections looks very psychadelic (sp?). Great title too.</td>', 'Very cool picture. The resulting contrasts of the reflections looks very psychadelic (sp?). Great title too.', '2004-06-14 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(762920, 83491, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, detail, and POV here. Possibly a +OEV adjustment or increased levels in Pshop to bring out a tad more detail in the shadowed areas would have helped imho?</td>', 'Great contrast, detail, and POV here. Possibly a +OEV adjustment or increased levels in Pshop to bring out a tad more detail in the shadowed areas would have helped imho?', '2004-06-14 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(762922, 83136, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and detail. Would have been nice to see the helicopter higher on the horizon compositionally. Obviously, you have no control over this though ; )</td>', 'Great DOF and detail. Would have been nice to see the helicopter higher on the horizon compositionally. Obviously, you have no control over this though ; )', '2004-06-14 15:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(762927, 83503, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture for its "back to the future" feel. You did a great job with the available lighting to bring out some nice details and colors.</td>', 'I really like this picture for its "back to the future" feel. You did a great job with the available lighting to bring out some nice details and colors.', '2004-06-14 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(762930, 83539, 22387, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-06-14 15:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(762933, 83426, 20235, '<td valign="top">Your use of the faded borders and b&amp;w creat a nice nostalgic feel. Very appropriate for the subject. Good detail and contrast throughout.</td>', 'Your use of the faded borders and b&w creat a nice nostalgic feel. Very appropriate for the subject. Good detail and contrast throughout.', '2004-06-14 15:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(762934, 83539, 21194, '<td valign="top">verry nice picture. I like the colours, and the idea is also interesting. :)</td>', 'verry nice picture. I like the colours, and the idea is also interesting. :)', '2004-06-14 15:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(762939, 82494, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like this picture because looking at all the faces  and expressions is very interesting. The man looking into the camera is somewhat distracting as it takes away from the candidness of the shot.</td>', 'I like this picture because looking at all the faces  and expressions is very interesting. The man looking into the camera is somewhat distracting as it takes away from the candidness of the shot.', '2004-06-14 15:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
