(762982, 83549, 16126, '<td valign="top">This would also do well in this week''s selective desat challenge! The red line is very effective here, excellent composition, clear sharp focus. 10</td>', 'This would also do well in this week''s selective desat challenge! The red line is very effective here, excellent composition, clear sharp focus. 10', '2004-06-14 16:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
