(763025, 83592, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think this is a unique shot - nicely chosen point of view, subject, composition...  But the depth of field really needs to be deeper for this to work.  Just seems like the majority of the subject is out of focus.</td>', 'I think this is a unique shot - nicely chosen point of view, subject, composition...  But the depth of field really needs to be deeper for this to work.  Just seems like the majority of the subject is out of focus.', '2004-06-14 17:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
