(763116, 82298, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure the reflection your trying to show here..I don''t think it''s working for the most part. The colors are really washed out and there is not focus or interest. Keep shooting.</td>', 'Not sure the reflection your trying to show here..I don''t think it''s working for the most part. The colors are really washed out and there is not focus or interest. Keep shooting.', '2004-06-14 18:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(763118, 83492, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the crop/composition is awkward on the rear of the car. I realized that this was not a posed shot. Good color and I like this for the action.</td>', 'I think the crop/composition is awkward on the rear of the car. I realized that this was not a posed shot. Good color and I like this for the action.', '2004-06-14 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(763120, 83301, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great panning, excellent color. I think that composition-wise a more frontal angle would be better, but it is so hard to get good photography positions at these kind of events.<br/>When was this? During the training/qualifying or the warming-up lap of the race. Shame he didn''t get any further than 400m or so in the race.<br/></td>', 'Great panning, excellent color. I think that composition-wise a more frontal angle would be better, but it is so hard to get good photography positions at these kind of events.When was this? During the training/qualifying or the warming-up lap of the race. Shame he didn''t get any further than 400m or so in the race.', '2004-06-14 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(763121, 83479, 327, '<td valign="top">Seems like too much going on in the background for this to stand alone. The shot is in good focus, but lacking a punch.</td>', 'Seems like too much going on in the background for this to stand alone. The shot is in good focus, but lacking a punch.', '2004-06-14 18:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
