(763170, 82512, 15207, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t get a ribbon I''ll be surprised. The lightning effect is awesome. Plus, I really like the way you composed it. I love teh angle.</td>', 'If this doesn''t get a ribbon I''ll be surprised. The lightning effect is awesome. Plus, I really like the way you composed it. I love teh angle.', '2004-06-14 19:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(763173, 83594, 15207, '<td valign="top">The colour saturation on this works really well - how coincidental that the next challenge will take advantage of this effect. The composition is very good as well. I find there''s a tiny bit of blur (but not too much) along the "school bus" writing in the front bus, suggesting that maybe there is a bit of motion blur (which is understandable since the buses appear to be rolling down the highway). A good capture for this challenge though - 9</td>', 'The colour saturation on this works really well - how coincidental that the next challenge will take advantage of this effect. The composition is very good as well. I find there''s a tiny bit of blur (but not too much) along the "school bus" writing in the front bus, suggesting that maybe there is a bit of motion blur (which is understandable since the buses appear to be rolling down the highway). A good capture for this challenge though - 9', '2004-06-14 19:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(763176, 83434, 15207, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Awesome. Awesome. As an owner of one of these wonderful buses, even more awesome. I just love the whole thing. Great whimsical quality with a bit of humour. Great model. Awesome capture with the plane going over head. What''s that song -- leavig on a jet plane. Kind of reminds me of that one. Great composition! If you don''t win a ribbon I''ll be surprised. 10</td>', 'Awesome. Awesome. Awesome. As an owner of one of these wonderful buses, even more awesome. I just love the whole thing. Great whimsical quality with a bit of humour. Great model. Awesome capture with the plane going over head. What''s that song -- leavig on a jet plane. Kind of reminds me of that one. Great composition! If you don''t win a ribbon I''ll be surprised. 10', '2004-06-14 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(763177, 83564, 15207, '<td valign="top">Man! I love this. I love that your eye is drawn right into the movement. THe lines here work perfect. This is excellent in black and white and the blur in teh sky and the contrast in the sky is really cool - really adds a lot of drama. Well done 10</td>', 'Man! I love this. I love that your eye is drawn right into the movement. THe lines here work perfect. This is excellent in black and white and the blur in teh sky and the contrast in the sky is really cool - really adds a lot of drama. Well done 10', '2004-06-14 19:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(763178, 82734, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really glad someone decided to do a close crop of a car feature rather than just taking a photo of a car sitting on a road. This one is particularly interesting and compelling becaues of the black and white. The contrast is just excellent. The tones are pitch perfect. The composition is a work of art 10</td>', 'Really glad someone decided to do a close crop of a car feature rather than just taking a photo of a car sitting on a road. This one is particularly interesting and compelling becaues of the black and white. The contrast is just excellent. The tones are pitch perfect. The composition is a work of art 10', '2004-06-14 19:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(763183, 83173, 15207, '<td valign="top">Oh man! What a great composition. The lighting is supurb and the contrast is pitch perfect. 10</td>', 'Oh man! What a great composition. The lighting is supurb and the contrast is pitch perfect. 10', '2004-06-14 19:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(763187, 83497, 15207, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! This is a great shot and is very well composed. On my monitor, some of the parts are slightly too dark (around the right back wheel), but overall the tones are very good. Excellent - 10</td>', 'Holy cow! This is a great shot and is very well composed. On my monitor, some of the parts are slightly too dark (around the right back wheel), but overall the tones are very good. Excellent - 10', '2004-06-14 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
