(763351, 83403, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2004-06-14 22:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(763352, 83136, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is a cool composition.  IMO the shot would have been better if the sky wasn''t so blown out and hazy.  A little more detail of the chopper would have made this more interesting to me.</td>', 'This is a cool composition.  IMO the shot would have been better if the sky wasn''t so blown out and hazy.  A little more detail of the chopper would have made this more interesting to me.', '2004-06-14 22:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(763354, 83482, 11078, '<td valign="top">interesting image very unusual and good detail but I dont see a train car or plane</td>', 'interesting image very unusual and good detail but I dont see a train car or plane', '2004-06-14 22:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(763355, 83600, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds, not enough airplane for my liking.  I might have included the whole window as a frame for a shot like this (at least for this particular challenge).</td>', 'Nice clouds, not enough airplane for my liking.  I might have included the whole window as a frame for a shot like this (at least for this particular challenge).', '2004-06-14 22:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(763356, 83559, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lucky you, you got to go to the F1 Grand Prix!  Nice shot, but it seems overexposed.  A -1 exposure compensation would have made it perfect.  The camera metered on the dark road and exposed the shot to make it look grey.</td>', 'Lucky you, you got to go to the F1 Grand Prix!  Nice shot, but it seems overexposed.  A -1 exposure compensation would have made it perfect.  The camera metered on the dark road and exposed the shot to make it look grey.', '2004-06-14 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(763357, 83567, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great shot, besides I love prowlers.  Great effort put into this shot.  One of two that moved me.  Good job.</td>', 'Great shot, besides I love prowlers.  Great effort put into this shot.  One of two that moved me.  Good job.', '2004-06-14 22:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(763358, 82512, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great effort put into this shot to make it interesting.  Great job.</td>', 'Very nice, great effort put into this shot to make it interesting.  Great job.', '2004-06-14 22:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(763360, 83066, 20235, '<td valign="top">What a great photo. The use of motion blur gives it a very kinetic feel.</td>', 'What a great photo. The use of motion blur gives it a very kinetic feel.', '2004-06-14 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(763361, 83487, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like this very much.  I know this is about planes, trains and automobiles but I would have liked to see the lighting on bride and groom (faces) a little bit lighter.  You got the shot set up right I don''t think one would detract from the other.  High marks.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like this very much.  I know this is about planes, trains and automobiles but I would have liked to see the lighting on bride and groom (faces) a little bit lighter.  You got the shot set up right I don''t think one would detract from the other.  High marks.', '2004-06-14 22:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(763363, 83557, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very cool, Car, lighting and setup excellent.  Great crop.   The only thing that would have made this perfect for me would be a shadowy figure next to the cop car.  Good job.</td>', 'Very cool, Car, lighting and setup excellent.  Great crop.   The only thing that would have made this perfect for me would be a shadowy figure next to the cop car.  Good job.', '2004-06-14 23:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(763365, 83133, 20235, '<td valign="top">Haha, love that alternate title.</td>', 'Haha, love that alternate title.', '2004-06-14 23:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(763366, 83434, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I know you would lose detail resizing down a larger pic, but I would have like to see a not so tight crop on the bottom and right side of this pic.  Excellent Job, I like the setup.  High Marks.</td>', 'Excellent.  I know you would lose detail resizing down a larger pic, but I would have like to see a not so tight crop on the bottom and right side of this pic.  Excellent Job, I like the setup.  High Marks.', '2004-06-14 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(763367, 83210, 21367, '<td valign="top">Simple and in focus.  The yellow background sets this above all the other planes in the air for me.  I like it.</td>', 'Simple and in focus.  The yellow background sets this above all the other planes in the air for me.  I like it.', '2004-06-14 23:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(763368, 83583, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. The framing/cropping looks a little un-even with more of the driver''s side healight cut off compared to the passenger side.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. The framing/cropping looks a little un-even with more of the driver''s side healight cut off compared to the passenger side.', '2004-06-14 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(763369, 83324, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like how you were able to get the entire Ford emblem in the framing.</td>', 'Good composition. I like how you were able to get the entire Ford emblem in the framing.', '2004-06-14 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(763370, 83469, 20235, '<td valign="top">Cool subject. But there are a few things that I find a little distracting in the shot. The reflection of a guy with knee-high socks in the glass and the over-exposed railing.</td>', 'Cool subject. But there are a few things that I find a little distracting in the shot. The reflection of a guy with knee-high socks in the glass and the over-exposed railing.', '2004-06-14 23:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(763371, 83281, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool contrast and textures here. The industrious look of the train  juxtaposed against the frailty of the flowers is nice.</td>', 'Very cool contrast and textures here. The industrious look of the train  juxtaposed against the frailty of the flowers is nice.', '2004-06-14 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(763374, 83549, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good title and use of selective desaturation to emphasize it. Composition and framing is good.</td>', 'Good title and use of selective desaturation to emphasize it. Composition and framing is good.', '2004-06-14 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(763375, 82736, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great angle. Looks like you were right on the threshold of 22R ; )<br/>The composition and way you framed the plane is great. I also like the cool colora pallete of the sky and plane in contrast with the "hot" landing lights.</td>', 'Great angle. Looks like you were right on the threshold of 22R ; )The composition and way you framed the plane is great. I also like the cool colora pallete of the sky and plane in contrast with the "hot" landing lights.', '2004-06-14 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(763378, 82812, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lots of compression artifacts.  Nice capture otherwise.</td>', 'Lots of compression artifacts.  Nice capture otherwise.', '2004-06-14 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(763379, 83425, 11518, '<td valign="top">Right place at the right time...</td>', 'Right place at the right time...', '2004-06-14 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(763381, 82808, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot and composition. Just a thought - If you held the camera at ankle level, used the 28mm end of the focal range to get a bit of barrel distorion, and then recomposed the shot.... The plane and tractor would have appeared much bigger and the effect of scale would be magnified. Nice picture though.</td>', 'Great shot and composition. Just a thought - If you held the camera at ankle level, used the 28mm end of the focal range to get a bit of barrel distorion, and then recomposed the shot.... The plane and tractor would have appeared much bigger and the effect of scale would be magnified. Nice picture though.', '2004-06-14 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(763382, 82759, 14053, '<td valign="top">A little blurry</td>', 'A little blurry', '2004-06-14 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(763385, 83590, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good subject. But for me the shot is really compromised by the busy power lines and poles in the background.</td>', 'Good subject. But for me the shot is really compromised by the busy power lines and poles in the background.', '2004-06-14 23:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(763386, 83372, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the subject in this photo. Unfortunately, the colors appear washed out and there is alot of noise/graininess visible.</td>', 'I love the subject in this photo. Unfortunately, the colors appear washed out and there is alot of noise/graininess visible.', '2004-06-14 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(763388, 83434, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL...nice timing...how long did you have to wait for the plane to come over?</td>', 'LOL...nice timing...how long did you have to wait for the plane to come over?', '2004-06-14 23:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(763389, 83301, 11518, '<td valign="top">Another lucky Montrealer who got to go to the Grand Prix, I''m jealous!  Great capture, great panning shot!</td>', 'Another lucky Montrealer who got to go to the Grand Prix, I''m jealous!  Great capture, great panning shot!', '2004-06-14 23:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(763391, 83555, 11518, '<td valign="top">Ya gotta love the shriners and their funny hats!</td>', 'Ya gotta love the shriners and their funny hats!', '2004-06-14 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(763392, 83572, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the subject here. But the noise and graininess, coupled with the somewhat messy selection during desaturation spoils it for me imho.</td>', 'I like the sky and the subject here. But the noise and graininess, coupled with the somewhat messy selection during desaturation spoils it for me imho.', '2004-06-14 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(763397, 83555, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.', '2004-06-14 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(763401, 83307, 14053, '<td valign="top">Too bad you cut offthe first 2 cars</td>', 'Too bad you cut offthe first 2 cars', '2004-06-14 23:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(763408, 83483, 14053, '<td valign="top">Way too blurry</td>', 'Way too blurry', '2004-06-14 23:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(763415, 83054, 14053, '<td valign="top">I like the stop motion propellers and the fact that they are both in the same position</td>', 'I like the stop motion propellers and the fact that they are both in the same position', '2004-06-14 23:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(763431, 83614, 10055, '<td valign="top">There is just something errie about deserted airlines out in a desert with such fenceing.....just chills...Nice work on the Deep DOF....also, the clouds just were right too....</td>', 'There is just something errie about deserted airlines out in a desert with such fenceing.....just chills...Nice work on the Deep DOF....also, the clouds just were right too....', '2004-06-15 00:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(763441, 83567, 327, '<td valign="top">I like these and would love to drive one. Love the purple.<br/>//www.justineo.com/vehicles/04v.htm</td>', 'I like these and would love to drive one. Love the purple.//www.justineo.com/vehicles/04v.htm', '2004-06-15 00:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
