(763492, 83553, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and good close up. I find the background busy although there''s a fair amount of blurring I feel that it''s too strong for the foreground to stand out. It''s nice that there''s very minimal color in it.</td>', 'Nice framing and good close up. I find the background busy although there''s a fair amount of blurring I feel that it''s too strong for the foreground to stand out. It''s nice that there''s very minimal color in it.', '2004-06-15 02:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
