(764075, 83301, 22677, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I still havn''t mastered the art of panning - you seem to have it spot on. The colours are very good here as well , the composition is pretty standard but works well in this case.</td>', 'Excellent, I still havn''t mastered the art of panning - you seem to have it spot on. The colours are very good here as well , the composition is pretty standard but works well in this case.', '2004-06-15 15:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
