(764078, 82761, 21362, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top picks of the challenge. It seems maybe a little overprocessed...? I honestly don''t know enough to say that for sure, but something about it seems a little unreal, as though it could be a painting instead of a photo. Still, it''s an interesting and beautiful subject and it pleases me to look at it, so well done. :)</td>', 'This is one of my top picks of the challenge. It seems maybe a little overprocessed...? I honestly don''t know enough to say that for sure, but something about it seems a little unreal, as though it could be a painting instead of a photo. Still, it''s an interesting and beautiful subject and it pleases me to look at it, so well done. :)', '2004-06-15 15:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(764083, 82809, 21362, '<td valign="top">Very clean and simple. I can''t figure out why the ground is solid black beyond the edges of the highway lanes, but it worked nicely for this image, keeping everything stark and man-made in appearance. High marks from me. :)</td>', 'Very clean and simple. I can''t figure out why the ground is solid black beyond the edges of the highway lanes, but it worked nicely for this image, keeping everything stark and man-made in appearance. High marks from me. :)', '2004-06-15 15:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(764088, 83603, 21362, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly exciting photo, but a bonus point for it being in Portland. ;)</td>', 'Not a particularly exciting photo, but a bonus point for it being in Portland. ;)', '2004-06-15 15:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
