(764096, 83356, 18517, '<td valign="top">Though the feeling that this shot is exceedingly generic overwhelms me, it''s a very nice shot. Lines aren''t horizontal to the edge, but I''m picky about those things.</td>', 'Though the feeling that this shot is exceedingly generic overwhelms me, it''s a very nice shot. Lines aren''t horizontal to the edge, but I''m picky about those things.', '2004-06-15 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
