(764231, 83594, 16106, '<td valign="top">funny shot , well de-saturated, but there is a lot of information here that isn''t contributing to the shot, a tighter lateral crop using just the busses whould have scored better from me at least.</td>', 'funny shot , well de-saturated, but there is a lot of information here that isn''t contributing to the shot, a tighter lateral crop using just the busses whould have scored better from me at least.', '2004-06-15 17:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
