(764832, 83536, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Feels like a Courior &amp; Ives print.  I like the blurred white circular border and the way it gives an other worldly feel to the subject. It also enhances the contrast of the photo which is quite effective. Hope this does well.</td>', 'Very nice. Feels like a Courior & Ives print.  I like the blurred white circular border and the way it gives an other worldly feel to the subject. It also enhances the contrast of the photo which is quite effective. Hope this does well.', '2004-06-16 01:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(764843, 83553, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Nice macro effect. The reflections are very powerful. I think the subject would be better served if the background was a bit more blurred. As it is, it detracts from my focus on the subject. I think I might has used PS to remove "dust and scratches." Highlights on the foreground right are a little distracting. Highlights on the metal are terrific.</td>', 'Nice photo. Nice macro effect. The reflections are very powerful. I think the subject would be better served if the background was a bit more blurred. As it is, it detracts from my focus on the subject. I think I might has used PS to remove "dust and scratches." Highlights on the foreground right are a little distracting. Highlights on the metal are terrific.', '2004-06-16 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(764854, 82368, 19009, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Yellow line really stands out.</td>', 'Nice.  Yellow line really stands out.', '2004-06-16 01:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(764857, 83549, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo of an historic vintage aircraft. Composition, lighting, focus and composition are very good. The title is a bit obscure and while it attracted me to the photo in the first place distracted me when i opened it.</td>', 'Very nice photo of an historic vintage aircraft. Composition, lighting, focus and composition are very good. The title is a bit obscure and while it attracted me to the photo in the first place distracted me when i opened it.', '2004-06-16 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(764860, 83526, 19009, '<td valign="top">Focus seems kind of soft.</td>', 'Focus seems kind of soft.', '2004-06-16 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(764861, 83452, 18197, '<td valign="top">Obviously the smoke is the subject of the photo and the plane only a necessary prop to explain the smoke. The levels, focus and colors of the smoke are fantastic. It may well have been impossible but if we could see a bit more than the silouette of the plane, I think it would have enhanced the photo. Still agreat photo and among my top pics.</td>', 'Obviously the smoke is the subject of the photo and the plane only a necessary prop to explain the smoke. The levels, focus and colors of the smoke are fantastic. It may well have been impossible but if we could see a bit more than the silouette of the plane, I think it would have enhanced the photo. Still agreat photo and among my top pics.', '2004-06-16 01:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(764864, 83614, 19009, '<td valign="top">Looks like Mojave CA.</td>', 'Looks like Mojave CA.', '2004-06-16 01:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(764869, 83477, 18197, '<td valign="top">I lke the way the airshow smoke leads you around the photo and adds a very dynamic feel. Colors, levels and focus are virtually perfect. Nicely done. Hope it does well.</td>', 'I lke the way the airshow smoke leads you around the photo and adds a very dynamic feel. Colors, levels and focus are virtually perfect. Nicely done. Hope it does well.', '2004-06-16 01:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
