(764887, 82812, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simple photo but not so simple to take and render. I like the nearly black sky and the high contrast with the subject. The sky especially is exceptionally and I like the way it gradients from midnight blue to black at the edges. Maybe it''s just my monitor but it''s very subtle. Among my top pics. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Simple photo but not so simple to take and render. I like the nearly black sky and the high contrast with the subject. The sky especially is exceptionally and I like the way it gradients from midnight blue to black at the edges. Maybe it''s just my monitor but it''s very subtle. Among my top pics. Hope it does well.', '2004-06-16 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(764890, 83284, 19009, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t quite get it.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t quite get it.', '2004-06-16 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(764896, 82724, 18197, '<td valign="top">Classic shot well executed. Love the focus, color and levels. Composition is good but a little cliche. But then again, how does a cliche become a cliche. Among my favorites for this challenge. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Classic shot well executed. Love the focus, color and levels. Composition is good but a little cliche. But then again, how does a cliche become a cliche. Among my favorites for this challenge. Hope it does well.', '2004-06-16 01:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
