(764909, 83206, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good subject, well composed. The background seems a bit washed out and would benefit from a bit of work with levels, curves and contrast. I like the river. It gives perspective and interest. It may not have been possible but if the observer could have been a bit higher, the river could have added additional interest.</td>', 'Nice photo, good subject, well composed. The background seems a bit washed out and would benefit from a bit of work with levels, curves and contrast. I like the river. It gives perspective and interest. It may not have been possible but if the observer could have been a bit higher, the river could have added additional interest.', '2004-06-16 01:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(764964, 83456, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the black background and the framing. The light reflections are somewhat distracting but probably out of your control. Good job overall...</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the black background and the framing. The light reflections are somewhat distracting but probably out of your control. Good job overall...', '2004-06-16 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
