(764976, 83481, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a shot, I''m not feeling very much from it though. I do like the color tone, I think I''m just thrown off by the roof. Nice shot overall, I think it could be a great one with a little more work.</td>', 'Nice idea for a shot, I''m not feeling very much from it though. I do like the color tone, I think I''m just thrown off by the roof. Nice shot overall, I think it could be a great one with a little more work.', '2004-06-16 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
