(765426, 83481, 17492, '<td valign="top">In this type of photo where lines disappear into the horizon, I think you''ll find rotating the image so that the vertical lines are perfectly vertical, will make your image far more pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'In this type of photo where lines disappear into the horizon, I think you''ll find rotating the image so that the vertical lines are perfectly vertical, will make your image far more pleasing to the eye.', '2004-06-16 08:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
