(765433, 82494, 17492, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on the man''s face.</td>', 'Love the expression on the man''s face.', '2004-06-16 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(765437, 82809, 14603, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous capture and great composition helps to make it a top shot.<br/>hope this does well...good luck</td>', 'What a fabulous capture and great composition helps to make it a top shot.hope this does well...good luck', '2004-06-16 08:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(765440, 83425, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great action shot ..well captured</td>', 'Great action shot ..well captured', '2004-06-16 08:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(765443, 83473, 14603, '<td valign="top">Simple but captivating..nicely exposed, giving good detail..I especially like the fact that the car door is open ..almost inviting you in to the shot.<br/>Hope people give this the attention it deserves...well done ..9</td>', 'Simple but captivating..nicely exposed, giving good detail..I especially like the fact that the car door is open ..almost inviting you in to the shot.Hope people give this the attention it deserves...well done ..9', '2004-06-16 08:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(765455, 83539, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot...one of my favourites so far. The only change I might have made would have been  to move the person slightly closer and to the left to minimise the "hotspot" on the platform..but overall, it`s a very good image.<br/>Well done...9<br/></td>', 'Lovely shot...one of my favourites so far. The only change I might have made would have been  to move the person slightly closer and to the left to minimise the "hotspot" on the platform..but overall, it`s a very good image.Well done...9', '2004-06-16 08:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(765460, 83572, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple but effective image..usually the tendency is to oversaturate the colour in the picture but you have not fallen into that trap..in fact, if anything, the buses could use a little brightening to make them stand out.<br/>That could just be down to my monitor though  :) Good work</td>', 'Nice, simple but effective image..usually the tendency is to oversaturate the colour in the picture but you have not fallen into that trap..in fact, if anything, the buses could use a little brightening to make them stand out.That could just be down to my monitor though  :) Good work', '2004-06-16 08:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(765466, 83066, 14603, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect you have got here (high key?) I suspect it was taken through a car windscreen ? as the white portion in the foreground which blots out the traffic island looks like a reflection. That is the only nitpick for me as the image is full of vitality and subtleness..from the person on their mobile to the reflection of the no entry sign on the moving bus..hope you don`t get too many "blown out sky" comments as that seems to be a favourite excuse for scoring down this type of work...absolutely brilliant and top marks from me...10</td>', 'I really like the effect you have got here (high key?) I suspect it was taken through a car windscreen ? as the white portion in the foreground which blots out the traffic island looks like a reflection. That is the only nitpick for me as the image is full of vitality and subtleness..from the person on their mobile to the reflection of the no entry sign on the moving bus..hope you don`t get too many "blown out sky" comments as that seems to be a favourite excuse for scoring down this type of work...absolutely brilliant and top marks from me...10', '2004-06-16 08:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(765475, 82751, 14603, '<td valign="top">You have used the light to your advantage in showing off the contours of this engine..it really gives the image bite..my only advice would be to have rearranged the image (if possible) so that you could crop the left hand side to get rid of the background which is showing signs of overprocessing..otherwise excellent.</td>', 'You have used the light to your advantage in showing off the contours of this engine..it really gives the image bite..my only advice would be to have rearranged the image (if possible) so that you could crop the left hand side to get rid of the background which is showing signs of overprocessing..otherwise excellent.', '2004-06-16 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(765486, 82728, 14603, '<td valign="top">There`s a nice interplay of light and shade in this image as well as good use of perspective...if only you could have avoided the diagonal wire and staunchion in the middle of the picture..the eye wants to follow the carriages as they disappear into the distance and the staunchion prevents this..otherwise a very good image.</td>', 'There`s a nice interplay of light and shade in this image as well as good use of perspective...if only you could have avoided the diagonal wire and staunchion in the middle of the picture..the eye wants to follow the carriages as they disappear into the distance and the staunchion prevents this..otherwise a very good image.', '2004-06-16 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(765494, 83442, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice original idea in which you can use light and shade to create your image.<br/>This has worked well in my opinion..very creative.</td>', 'Nice original idea in which you can use light and shade to create your image.This has worked well in my opinion..very creative.', '2004-06-16 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(765513, 83429, 14603, '<td valign="top">Simple but powerful...it`s not always easy to make a good photograph from very little, but you have managed to do it here..great colour..great composition, the light and shade showing off the contours of the "Concorde?" to perfection.<br/>My only nitpick is that little rogue cloud at the bottom..which distracts slightly.<br/>Overall...great work</td>', 'Simple but powerful...it`s not always easy to make a good photograph from very little, but you have managed to do it here..great colour..great composition, the light and shade showing off the contours of the "Concorde?" to perfection.My only nitpick is that little rogue cloud at the bottom..which distracts slightly.Overall...great work', '2004-06-16 09:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(765518, 83477, 14603, '<td valign="top">I`ve noticed one or two of this type of shot in the challenge..but this one is my favourite..beatifully captured.</td>', 'I`ve noticed one or two of this type of shot in the challenge..but this one is my favourite..beatifully captured.', '2004-06-16 09:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(765576, 83567, 16004, '<td valign="top">blurring the background does give some impression of speed, but the wheels being so sharp and defined and the tyre treads being clearly visible dimishes the impact and makes it look a bit odd. possibly blurring the bright reflection in the door would also help.  to be honest, the prowler is such an unusual damn sexy menacing looking car that even stationary it would look quite imposing and dramatic.   it''s a good choice of car, i think the angle and crop is well done and interestingly different (cropping close to the top of the window accenuates the squatness of the car).  6.</td>', 'blurring the background does give some impression of speed, but the wheels being so sharp and defined and the tyre treads being clearly visible dimishes the impact and makes it look a bit odd. possibly blurring the bright reflection in the door would also help.  to be honest, the prowler is such an unusual damn sexy menacing looking car that even stationary it would look quite imposing and dramatic.   it''s a good choice of car, i think the angle and crop is well done and interestingly different (cropping close to the top of the window accenuates the squatness of the car).  6.', '2004-06-16 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(765678, 83210, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Very nice.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Very nice.', '2004-06-16 11:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(765679, 83442, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Like the surreal quality.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Like the surreal quality.', '2004-06-16 11:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(765680, 83469, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo...but the reflection of the guy in the tube socks just really doesn''t add any artistic touches to it. ;o)  Hope you didn''t get arrested taking the photo!</td>', 'Interesting photo...but the reflection of the guy in the tube socks just really doesn''t add any artistic touches to it. ;o)  Hope you didn''t get arrested taking the photo!', '2004-06-16 11:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(765682, 82512, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Excellent angle and lines! ;o)</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Excellent angle and lines! ;o)', '2004-06-16 11:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(765683, 83491, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, but I think it could really be nice with maybe a B&amp;W treatment, a little noise, or something to age it...the red door kind of jumps out at you and takes away from the nostalgic feeling.  Just my 2 cents... Good shot. :o)</td>', 'This is a good photo, but I think it could really be nice with maybe a B&W treatment, a little noise, or something to age it...the red door kind of jumps out at you and takes away from the nostalgic feeling.  Just my 2 cents... Good shot. :o)', '2004-06-16 11:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(765684, 83050, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  I really like the yellow...the colors pop! ;o)</td>', 'Nice angle.  I really like the yellow...the colors pop! ;o)', '2004-06-16 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(765685, 83365, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful sky shot.  Love the negative space.</td>', 'Very beautiful sky shot.  Love the negative space.', '2004-06-16 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(765686, 83133, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute title...glad you can keep a sense of humor around this place!  Those seem to be in short supply here lately.  ;o)</td>', 'Cute title...glad you can keep a sense of humor around this place!  Those seem to be in short supply here lately.  ;o)', '2004-06-16 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(765687, 83534, 18349, '<td valign="top">Twinkies!  ;O)</td>', 'Twinkies!  ;O)', '2004-06-16 11:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(765688, 83241, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract.   Don''t know how it will go over with the bulk of the voters, but I appreciate it.  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful abstract.   Don''t know how it will go over with the bulk of the voters, but I appreciate it.  :o)', '2004-06-16 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(765689, 82256, 18349, '<td valign="top">A little wider angle and you''d get the automobiles in the lot on the right! :o)</td>', 'A little wider angle and you''d get the automobiles in the lot on the right! :o)', '2004-06-16 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(765691, 83523, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful treatment...very nostalgic feel. :o)</td>', 'Beautiful treatment...very nostalgic feel. :o)', '2004-06-16 11:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(765694, 83593, 16301, '<td valign="top">I suggest photographing a more appealing car with a background that provides some interest, otherwise there is nothing that draws interest here. Good luck...</td>', 'I suggest photographing a more appealing car with a background that provides some interest, otherwise there is nothing that draws interest here. Good luck...', '2004-06-16 11:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(765716, 83493, 18517, '<td valign="top">Is there someone behind the wheel? I think a lot of people in this challenge found KIT replicas that drive themselves through photoshop filters.</td>', 'Is there someone behind the wheel? I think a lot of people in this challenge found KIT replicas that drive themselves through photoshop filters.', '2004-06-16 11:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(765857, 83434, 18517, '<td valign="top">Awesome! But I didn''t know there were hippies in Canada. Extra point for the skirt. Seems like there could have been a better angle to eliminate the sun wash and my mind wants to close that door.</td>', 'Awesome! But I didn''t know there were hippies in Canada. Extra point for the skirt. Seems like there could have been a better angle to eliminate the sun wash and my mind wants to close that door.', '2004-06-16 12:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(765911, 83582, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a very cool pic, really makes me think of driving after a rain, but I would have cloned out the light spots in the upper right; and the border along the top is a little distracting/confusing from the horizon, a plain colored border may have worked better</td>', 'this is a very cool pic, really makes me think of driving after a rain, but I would have cloned out the light spots in the upper right; and the border along the top is a little distracting/confusing from the horizon, a plain colored border may have worked better', '2004-06-16 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(765929, 83434, 11895, '<td valign="top">excellent entry, too bad it is a little bright along the left side, I can hear your subject singing the old PP&amp;M song</td>', 'excellent entry, too bad it is a little bright along the left side, I can hear your subject singing the old PP&M song', '2004-06-16 13:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(765963, 83532, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, border is subtle, colors are bright but not oversaturated, maybe not so closely cropped at the top would have been a little better</td>', 'I really like this shot, border is subtle, colors are bright but not oversaturated, maybe not so closely cropped at the top would have been a little better', '2004-06-16 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(765995, 83604, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the textures in this, composure and exposure are very good, but I would have put the rear windows down for the photo to enhance the long &amp; low look</td>', 'I really like the colors and the textures in this, composure and exposure are very good, but I would have put the rear windows down for the photo to enhance the long & low look', '2004-06-16 13:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(765996, 82728, 11895, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, love the depth of field, and you did a good job of capturing both shadow and sunlight</td>', 'excellent shot, love the depth of field, and you did a good job of capturing both shadow and sunlight', '2004-06-16 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(766014, 83463, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this pic and the car; shiny cars and chrome in bright sun are a difficult capture and you did it well; cropping to get all of the fender on the right, and maybe cleaning up the grass with clone tool would have improved it a bit</td>', 'I like this pic and the car; shiny cars and chrome in bright sun are a difficult capture and you did it well; cropping to get all of the fender on the right, and maybe cleaning up the grass with clone tool would have improved it a bit', '2004-06-16 13:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(766018, 82736, 11895, '<td valign="top">getting enough light on the underside of a plane is difficult, good job</td>', 'getting enough light on the underside of a plane is difficult, good job', '2004-06-16 13:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(766027, 82724, 11895, '<td valign="top">you did a good job of getting enough light on the underside of the plane</td>', 'you did a good job of getting enough light on the underside of the plane', '2004-06-16 13:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(766038, 83614, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good capture, I can almost feel the desert heat, love the depth of field, wish the challenge topic/subject (the planes) were bigger, their role in this composition makes them sort of subordinate to the fence and the sky</td>', 'very good capture, I can almost feel the desert heat, love the depth of field, wish the challenge topic/subject (the planes) were bigger, their role in this composition makes them sort of subordinate to the fence and the sky', '2004-06-16 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(766040, 83173, 16829, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot. Its too bad the lighting did not allow for more detail.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot. Its too bad the lighting did not allow for more detail.', '2004-06-16 13:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(766042, 83066, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the still person with the moving bus behind them, but I don''t care for the overexposure on most of the shot.</td>', 'I like the still person with the moving bus behind them, but I don''t care for the overexposure on most of the shot.', '2004-06-16 13:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(766043, 83498, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice pic that fits the topic well but the crop is too close on the right and botom, it makes the train look sort of "pinched"</td>', 'very nice pic that fits the topic well but the crop is too close on the right and botom, it makes the train look sort of "pinched"', '2004-06-16 13:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(766049, 82701, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good depth of field, the subdued colors add to the feel of this one</td>', 'very good depth of field, the subdued colors add to the feel of this one', '2004-06-16 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(766051, 83503, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good gritty shot with lots of DOF.</td>', 'Good gritty shot with lots of DOF.', '2004-06-16 13:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(766052, 83497, 13136, '<td valign="top">I love the dark, high contrast in this shot.</td>', 'I love the dark, high contrast in this shot.', '2004-06-16 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(766061, 83398, 11895, '<td valign="top">a nice, clean BelAir, I like the idea of the classy car backgrounded by a sunset but here the sunset dominates the car a little too much for my tastes, especially since it is a car challenge, not a sunset challenge; there is not enough light on the side of the car causing loss in detail fading to no definition at the front tire</td>', 'a nice, clean BelAir, I like the idea of the classy car backgrounded by a sunset but here the sunset dominates the car a little too much for my tastes, especially since it is a car challenge, not a sunset challenge; there is not enough light on the side of the car causing loss in detail fading to no definition at the front tire', '2004-06-16 13:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(766065, 83593, 13136, '<td valign="top">The train is just too hard to distinguish here.</td>', 'The train is just too hard to distinguish here.', '2004-06-16 13:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(766066, 83307, 18748, '<td valign="top">WOuld be much better to see curve of the train in the shot also.  Otherwise nice,reminds of Harry Potter movie :)</td>', 'WOuld be much better to see curve of the train in the shot also.  Otherwise nice,reminds of Harry Potter movie :)', '2004-06-16 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(766069, 83459, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition but the colors look weak, more contrast and maybe just a little more saturation would have improved this shot</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition but the colors look weak, more contrast and maybe just a little more saturation would have improved this shot', '2004-06-16 13:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(766075, 82222, 18748, '<td valign="top">Nice,very nice.  B/W makes this shot very unusuall.</td>', 'Nice,very nice.  B/W makes this shot very unusuall.', '2004-06-16 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(766078, 82368, 11895, '<td valign="top">very pleasing composition, the contrast in textures from floor to train add a lot</td>', 'very pleasing composition, the contrast in textures from floor to train add a lot', '2004-06-16 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(766086, 83501, 11895, '<td valign="top">late ''60''s Dodge?    nice pic, firts the challenge well but I wish there was some more definition between the tire and the ground</td>', 'late ''60''s Dodge?    nice pic, firts the challenge well but I wish there was some more definition between the tire and the ground', '2004-06-16 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(766087, 83523, 17166, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better in color - the old timey feel doesn''t really suit the modern diesel engine, and color would show off the bright yellow and red UP paint scheme.</td>', 'I think this would look better in color - the old timey feel doesn''t really suit the modern diesel engine, and color would show off the bright yellow and red UP paint scheme.', '2004-06-16 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(766089, 83575, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like the vignetting in the corners - adds to the old time feel.</td>', 'I like the vignetting in the corners - adds to the old time feel.', '2004-06-16 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(766094, 83054, 11895, '<td valign="top">you did well to get some light on the underside of the plane at a shutter speed fast enough to stop the props, nice capture</td>', 'you did well to get some light on the underside of the plane at a shutter speed fast enough to stop the props, nice capture', '2004-06-16 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(766095, 83134, 18748, '<td valign="top">Is thas our "beautiful" New York subway ?</td>', 'Is thas our "beautiful" New York subway ?', '2004-06-16 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(766099, 83450, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice subject, fits the challenge well, but it seems to me that your conversion to B&amp;W has made the sky look unreal, maybe color would have looked better and scored higher</td>', 'nice subject, fits the challenge well, but it seems to me that your conversion to B&W has made the sky look unreal, maybe color would have looked better and scored higher', '2004-06-16 14:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(766102, 82222, 11895, '<td valign="top">pretty dark, can''t see much detail in the convertible</td>', 'pretty dark, can''t see much detail in the convertible', '2004-06-16 14:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(766107, 83497, 11895, '<td valign="top">good capture, but your conversion to B&amp;W has made the background pretty dark, maybe color would have let the subject stand out without losing detail in the rest of the pic</td>', 'good capture, but your conversion to B&W has made the background pretty dark, maybe color would have let the subject stand out without losing detail in the rest of the pic', '2004-06-16 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(766113, 83066, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but your background is too light/desaturated, balance between realism and artistic has gone a bit too far</td>', 'I like the idea here but your background is too light/desaturated, balance between realism and artistic has gone a bit too far', '2004-06-16 14:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(766156, 82734, 12017, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10, if i could, i''d give you a 20....</td>', 'Perfect 10, if i could, i''d give you a 20....', '2004-06-16 14:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(766166, 82751, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice colors together.</td>', 'Nice colors together.', '2004-06-16 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(766414, 83349, 20941, '<td valign="top">creative for this challenge, I like that</td>', 'creative for this challenge, I like that', '2004-06-16 17:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
