(766715, 83398, 714, '<td valign="top">What a beauty!  I really like these old chevy''s.  My favorite car is a 57'' Chevy.  Got to love a good old beast. :-)  10 from me.</td>', 'What a beauty!  I really like these old chevy''s.  My favorite car is a 57'' Chevy.  Got to love a good old beast. :-)  10 from me.', '2004-06-16 20:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(766718, 83379, 714, '<td valign="top">This is another of my favorites.  Well done.  I love the tones and lighting.</td>', 'This is another of my favorites.  Well done.  I love the tones and lighting.', '2004-06-16 20:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(766720, 82494, 714, '<td valign="top">Man, this guy is really unhappy.  Bummer for him.  I bet he didn''t appreciate his photo being taken.  I like the dof here.</td>', 'Man, this guy is really unhappy.  Bummer for him.  I bet he didn''t appreciate his photo being taken.  I like the dof here.', '2004-06-16 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
