(767286, 83549, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice discreet example of selected desat.  for me, it''s not all that exciting, but it''s certainly a well-crafted shot and it''s quite peaceful and soothing.  the tones are wonderful, as is the lighting.  it''s a shame nothing else was red (liek the horizontal stripe, for example).  it''s a beautful aircraft, so subject choice is good.  might have cropped a little off the bottom - the complexity of the top bit of undercarriage detracts slightly from the rest of the plane.  that said, it''s a very likeable shot.  8.</td>', 'nice discreet example of selected desat.  for me, it''s not all that exciting, but it''s certainly a well-crafted shot and it''s quite peaceful and soothing.  the tones are wonderful, as is the lighting.  it''s a shame nothing else was red (liek the horizontal stripe, for example).  it''s a beautful aircraft, so subject choice is good.  might have cropped a little off the bottom - the complexity of the top bit of undercarriage detracts slightly from the rest of the plane.  that said, it''s a very likeable shot.  8.', '2004-06-17 06:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(767291, 83166, 16301, '<td valign="top">The helicopter is cut off, I think including more of it in the frame would have been better. Also, the view here doesn''t help show the helicopter. The composition is somewhat busy and distracting, thats because of where you were standing. My advice is to find a better view and put some thought into your composition before taking the photo.<br/> <br/> Good luck...</td>', 'The helicopter is cut off, I think including more of it in the frame would have been better. Also, the view here doesn''t help show the helicopter. The composition is somewhat busy and distracting, thats because of where you were standing. My advice is to find a better view and put some thought into your composition before taking the photo.  Good luck...', '2004-06-17 06:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(767292, 83173, 16301, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a dull shot in color, excellent job with the B&amp;W, it works well with it.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'I think this would have been a dull shot in color, excellent job with the B&W, it works well with it. Good luck...', '2004-06-17 06:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
