(767349, 83498, 16004, '<td valign="top">well, that''s a sexy looking train...  or is it a tram?  same thing i guess.  been searching my brain for remembering where this is - i know that brown building on the right...  anyway, it''s a pleasant picture, though the traim has been cropped a little bit close to the right for my liking.  the skyline and the sky is a nice touch, and compliments well, although perhaps selecting and reducing the brightness of the sky a shade might be slightly more fitting?  final note is that i might have tried taking the shot ten feet down the road; the junction of wires at the cross-roads is a bit too cluttered...</td>', 'well, that''s a sexy looking train...  or is it a tram?  same thing i guess.  been searching my brain for remembering where this is - i know that brown building on the right...  anyway, it''s a pleasant picture, though the traim has been cropped a little bit close to the right for my liking.  the skyline and the sky is a nice touch, and compliments well, although perhaps selecting and reducing the brightness of the sky a shade might be slightly more fitting?  final note is that i might have tried taking the shot ten feet down the road; the junction of wires at the cross-roads is a bit too cluttered...', '2004-06-17 08:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(767350, 83590, 16004, '<td valign="top">If you cloned out the pole, i think it would be more impressive.  though then of course it would look like it''s about to crash into some electric cables, so they''d have to go as well.  big labourious job that would be.  the reflection in the cars bonnet or roof IS a nice touch, and gives it a degree of originality.  lastly, i think it''s a little too dark for my tastes, but that''s just me.</td>', 'If you cloned out the pole, i think it would be more impressive.  though then of course it would look like it''s about to crash into some electric cables, so they''d have to go as well.  big labourious job that would be.  the reflection in the cars bonnet or roof IS a nice touch, and gives it a degree of originality.  lastly, i think it''s a little too dark for my tastes, but that''s just me.', '2004-06-17 09:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
