(767377, 83301, 16004, '<td valign="top">excellent job - the car is perfect; it''s bright, sharp, clear, totally impressive.  it''s in amongst slightly too much background maybe, but that aside, unfaultable.  it''s interesting (even though i would personally prefer alonso, who''s my favourite) nad and gives a real sense of speed.  the best moving car shot here.  10.</td>', 'excellent job - the car is perfect; it''s bright, sharp, clear, totally impressive.  it''s in amongst slightly too much background maybe, but that aside, unfaultable.  it''s interesting (even though i would personally prefer alonso, who''s my favourite) nad and gives a real sense of speed.  the best moving car shot here.  10.', '2004-06-17 09:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(767381, 82734, 16004, '<td valign="top">In my book this is certainly abstract.  I like the geometric shapes and the crop is great.  the way you''ve only got black, white and silver in the shot is very nice, as is the fact you can''t see the edge of the tyres under the arch.  never said this before, but i think a slightly thicker border might actually be beneficial here!  very very good.  9.</td>', 'In my book this is certainly abstract.  I like the geometric shapes and the crop is great.  the way you''ve only got black, white and silver in the shot is very nice, as is the fact you can''t see the edge of the tyres under the arch.  never said this before, but i think a slightly thicker border might actually be beneficial here!  very very good.  9.', '2004-06-17 10:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
