(767524, 83613, 16004, '<td valign="top">oooh, nice heat haze!  i like this; the black fighter (F15?) looks very menacing.  it''s slightly lessened by the blue van in the background, but i think it is improved by the small, red light on the wing...  angle of view is spot on in my book.  i might have cropped at the tip of the tail fins (thereby losing the whiter gable roof of the hanger), and maybe reduce the brightness a tiny bit, but they''re minor things onan otherwise quality shot.  8.</td>', 'oooh, nice heat haze!  i like this; the black fighter (F15?) looks very menacing.  it''s slightly lessened by the blue van in the background, but i think it is improved by the small, red light on the wing...  angle of view is spot on in my book.  i might have cropped at the tip of the tail fins (thereby losing the whiter gable roof of the hanger), and maybe reduce the brightness a tiny bit, but they''re minor things onan otherwise quality shot.  8.', '2004-06-17 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
