(768203, 83570, 22976, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you turned a little to the left, the car would appear more powerful.  I know these cars and they need to be portrayed that way.  Another suggestion, show a little bit fo the tire turned tword the camera showing a bit of tread.  That way it looks like the car is coming out of the picture.</td>', 'Maybe if you turned a little to the left, the car would appear more powerful.  I know these cars and they need to be portrayed that way.  Another suggestion, show a little bit fo the tire turned tword the camera showing a bit of tread.  That way it looks like the car is coming out of the picture.', '2004-06-18 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
