(768320, 83015, 9668, '<td valign="top">I think this picture may not be like because it doesn''t depict an airplane as a main subject. However, it''s different, and I like it for that. England eh? Is he looking through binoculars? Nice split of the frame: Kid in one, plane in the other. Kid looking at the plane, plane taking off into the other frame. Nice complextion. I know it''s almost impossible, but I would like to see the plane futher into the middle of the pane. Lighting is a bit uneven: left is brighter than the right, I would also rather see all of the kid in detail, or have him totally sillouhetted. Overall: nice job. Different view or an airplane.</td>', 'I think this picture may not be like because it doesn''t depict an airplane as a main subject. However, it''s different, and I like it for that. England eh? Is he looking through binoculars? Nice split of the frame: Kid in one, plane in the other. Kid looking at the plane, plane taking off into the other frame. Nice complextion. I know it''s almost impossible, but I would like to see the plane futher into the middle of the pane. Lighting is a bit uneven: left is brighter than the right, I would also rather see all of the kid in detail, or have him totally sillouhetted. Overall: nice job. Different view or an airplane.', '2004-06-18 05:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(768327, 83382, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cute and original, but I don''t really like it. Doesn''t really stand out. To me it''s like "Well there''s a kid on a train in a parade." I think a smaller DOF would have been nice too, to have just the train in focus, and not the crowd and the lady walking in the background. Nice idea though, fun parade. 4</td>', 'Cute and original, but I don''t really like it. Doesn''t really stand out. To me it''s like "Well there''s a kid on a train in a parade." I think a smaller DOF would have been nice too, to have just the train in focus, and not the crowd and the lady walking in the background. Nice idea though, fun parade. 4', '2004-06-18 05:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(768359, 83592, 16004, '<td valign="top">now what you should have done is taped the camera to the wing with electrical tape and take the picture in-flight.  of course, if you don''t have a remote or a tmier more than 10-seconds, it would have to involve you being taped to the wing as well, and that would just be silly.  i like this one loads; DOF is great, lighting and tones perfect, and general feel top notch.  in fact, 10!</td>', 'now what you should have done is taped the camera to the wing with electrical tape and take the picture in-flight.  of course, if you don''t have a remote or a tmier more than 10-seconds, it would have to involve you being taped to the wing as well, and that would just be silly.  i like this one loads; DOF is great, lighting and tones perfect, and general feel top notch.  in fact, 10!', '2004-06-18 06:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
