(768564, 83600, 22781, '<td valign="top">This looks like it is.<br/>A picture taken out of a window of an airplane.<br/>It meets the challenge, but is not realy interesting.<br/>Everybody that was once in a plane has one just like this.<br/> <br/>Maybe you could have asked to take a look in the cockpit and photograph from there, that would be a bit more interesting.<br/></td>', 'This looks like it is.A picture taken out of a window of an airplane.It meets the challenge, but is not realy interesting.Everybody that was once in a plane has one just like this. Maybe you could have asked to take a look in the cockpit and photograph from there, that would be a bit more interesting.', '2004-06-18 12:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(768569, 83382, 22781, '<td valign="top">Yep, it meets the challenge, but if you would have used a different angle to shoot, or at least try to avoid all those other people on your photo....</td>', 'Yep, it meets the challenge, but if you would have used a different angle to shoot, or at least try to avoid all those other people on your photo....', '2004-06-18 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(768573, 83338, 22781, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5, don''t know why because I think its better then most 5''s i''ve given so far.<br/>It''s a good picture I guess but it just doesn''t capture me...</td>', 'I gave you a 5, don''t know why because I think its better then most 5''s i''ve given so far.It''s a good picture I guess but it just doesn''t capture me...', '2004-06-18 12:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(768578, 83434, 22781, '<td valign="top">The model is nicem the idea is nice, the sky is nice, it meets the challenge, but there is no WOW factor here... (6)</td>', 'The model is nicem the idea is nice, the sky is nice, it meets the challenge, but there is no WOW factor here... (6)', '2004-06-18 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(768579, 83594, 22781, '<td valign="top">Take it again and submit it to the selective desat challenge :)</td>', 'Take it again and submit it to the selective desat challenge :)', '2004-06-18 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(768580, 82809, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is 1 of my 2 10''s... Love to know how you did this!<br/>Please, I did not vote 10 to receive nothing back :)</td>', 'This is 1 of my 2 10''s... Love to know how you did this!Please, I did not vote 10 to receive nothing back :)', '2004-06-18 12:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(768624, 83475, 6999, '<td valign="top">Looks like west London, though I suppose it could be anywhere. Great use of the wide-angle, imposing sihouette of plane; i really hope people vote for the impact of the shot rather than getting hung up on the skyline or something petty like that - but you''ve given them the chance. 7 from me, for now.</td>', 'Looks like west London, though I suppose it could be anywhere. Great use of the wide-angle, imposing sihouette of plane; i really hope people vote for the impact of the shot rather than getting hung up on the skyline or something petty like that - but you''ve given them the chance. 7 from me, for now.', '2004-06-18 13:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(768632, 83599, 6999, '<td valign="top">Composition of this kind of shot is so tricky, and I''m not wholly convinced you''ve got it exactly: having looked at it a while, I wonder if the two focal points of the car - the fuel cap and the name badge, are perhaps unbalanced within the frame: perhaps using those as the twin focal points of the image would give a happier mix of car and sky - this way, I feel, its too even a division, not asking us to consider one or the other primarily, and thus leading to a divided sense of subject. 6</td>', 'Composition of this kind of shot is so tricky, and I''m not wholly convinced you''ve got it exactly: having looked at it a while, I wonder if the two focal points of the car - the fuel cap and the name badge, are perhaps unbalanced within the frame: perhaps using those as the twin focal points of the image would give a happier mix of car and sky - this way, I feel, its too even a division, not asking us to consider one or the other primarily, and thus leading to a divided sense of subject. 6', '2004-06-18 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(768728, 83539, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I might suggest cloning out the green sign on the left, but it doesn''t detract from this.  The leading lines work nicely with the slightly off center composition</td>', 'Nice shot, I might suggest cloning out the green sign on the left, but it doesn''t detract from this.  The leading lines work nicely with the slightly off center composition', '2004-06-18 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(768729, 83066, 509, '<td valign="top">The highlites look blown out to me.  While this was probably intentional, it''s distracting to my eye.  I do like the motion blur however.  If it was a compromise of exposure (slow shutter speed to blur motion in bright daylight) a neutral density filter might have helped.</td>', 'The highlites look blown out to me.  While this was probably intentional, it''s distracting to my eye.  I do like the motion blur however.  If it was a compromise of exposure (slow shutter speed to blur motion in bright daylight) a neutral density filter might have helped.', '2004-06-18 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(768734, 83482, 509, '<td valign="top">It looks to me like this might be a train car, but the composition doesn''t work well imho.  My eyes are drawn to the building with the "open" sign, but that is clearly not the selling point of this image.  I think a different angle on the diner (to the left, showing about the same amount of train car (if thats what it in fact is) and less of the building structure might work.</td>', 'It looks to me like this might be a train car, but the composition doesn''t work well imho.  My eyes are drawn to the building with the "open" sign, but that is clearly not the selling point of this image.  I think a different angle on the diner (to the left, showing about the same amount of train car (if thats what it in fact is) and less of the building structure might work.', '2004-06-18 15:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(768737, 82760, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - if I had time I would''ve stopped by the East Broad Top (narrow gauge) lines in PA.  I''m guessing that this isn''t EBT, but as I haven''t been there, I don''t really know...  Compositionally I think this could be a little stronger.  Since the primary subject is the steam engine, I would try holding the camera a little lower to the ground, possibly framing the shot with the outer rails on the two tracks.  A shallower depth of field might also help put a dramatic emphasis on the engine.  Overall a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice subject - if I had time I would''ve stopped by the East Broad Top (narrow gauge) lines in PA.  I''m guessing that this isn''t EBT, but as I haven''t been there, I don''t really know...  Compositionally I think this could be a little stronger.  Since the primary subject is the steam engine, I would try holding the camera a little lower to the ground, possibly framing the shot with the outer rails on the two tracks.  A shallower depth of field might also help put a dramatic emphasis on the engine.  Overall a nice shot.', '2004-06-18 15:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(768738, 83475, 509, '<td valign="top">The rounded/tilted bottom of the shot puts this into the perspective that its heading right at you!  I think some levels adjustment and unsharp mask in photoshop could make this stand out a bit more.  Great photo op and nice execution</td>', 'The rounded/tilted bottom of the shot puts this into the perspective that its heading right at you!  I think some levels adjustment and unsharp mask in photoshop could make this stand out a bit more.  Great photo op and nice execution', '2004-06-18 15:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(768741, 83473, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting low-key shot</td>', 'Interesting low-key shot', '2004-06-18 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(768744, 83598, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject = )</td>', 'Nice composition and subject = )', '2004-06-18 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(768746, 83439, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space, but for this shot, I don''t think the tree is necessary to add perspective.  Probably wasn''t possible, but a little more zoom (while still keeping both planes in the shot) could add to this.  Nice catch with them both parting the cloud</td>', 'I like the use of negative space, but for this shot, I don''t think the tree is necessary to add perspective.  Probably wasn''t possible, but a little more zoom (while still keeping both planes in the shot) could add to this.  Nice catch with them both parting the cloud', '2004-06-18 15:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(768749, 83265, 509, '<td valign="top">Several distracting elements in this shot.  I think the idea is ok (with the title it makes it more interesting than say an ordinary pickup truck), but I feel the composition could be improved.</td>', 'Several distracting elements in this shot.  I think the idea is ok (with the title it makes it more interesting than say an ordinary pickup truck), but I feel the composition could be improved.', '2004-06-18 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(768751, 83387, 509, '<td valign="top">Lighting could have been improved for this shot to eliminate the shadows and possibly bring some separation of the car from the backdrop</td>', 'Lighting could have been improved for this shot to eliminate the shadows and possibly bring some separation of the car from the backdrop', '2004-06-18 15:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(768753, 83120, 509, '<td valign="top">Great train shot!  Black and white does well here.  I like the setting also, it really plays to your title</td>', 'Great train shot!  Black and white does well here.  I like the setting also, it really plays to your title', '2004-06-18 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(768755, 83575, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and use of dodging/burning.  The shot is nicely framed and has a lot of interest.</td>', 'Nice contrast and use of dodging/burning.  The shot is nicely framed and has a lot of interest.', '2004-06-18 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(768757, 83497, 509, '<td valign="top">I like how the white jet is really set apart from the darker background.  Adds a little 3-dimensional look to the shot.</td>', 'I like how the white jet is really set apart from the darker background.  Adds a little 3-dimensional look to the shot.', '2004-06-18 15:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(768760, 83559, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot and composition.  It looks as though there might be a some compression artifacts or overprocessing with software such as Neat Image.  Still, great catch</td>', 'Nice action shot and composition.  It looks as though there might be a some compression artifacts or overprocessing with software such as Neat Image.  Still, great catch', '2004-06-18 15:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(768764, 83307, 509, '<td valign="top">I love steam engine pics = )  I''d prefer to see the full train (cropped less tightly on the left), but the detail is very sharp and the composition is nice (looks as though the train has been travelling from one corner of the frame to the next).  Very nice</td>', 'I love steam engine pics = )  I''d prefer to see the full train (cropped less tightly on the left), but the detail is very sharp and the composition is nice (looks as though the train has been travelling from one corner of the frame to the next).  Very nice', '2004-06-18 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(768765, 83555, 509, '<td valign="top">Well, it is a funny car - good subject.  I''d prefer a shallower depth of field and a little more contrast.</td>', 'Well, it is a funny car - good subject.  I''d prefer a shallower depth of field and a little more contrast.', '2004-06-18 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(768767, 83596, 509, '<td valign="top">Now for some irony with the title, having the jeep flipped on its side would look great, but I wouldn''t recommend doing that just for a photo ; )</td>', 'Now for some irony with the title, having the jeep flipped on its side would look great, but I wouldn''t recommend doing that just for a photo ; )', '2004-06-18 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(768769, 83526, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the selective focus here.  Very nice shot</td>', 'I like the selective focus here.  Very nice shot', '2004-06-18 15:57:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(768770, 82759, 509, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice in that the stripe on the top and the gate on the bottom fall precisely into the right side corners.</td>', 'The composition is nice in that the stripe on the top and the gate on the bottom fall precisely into the right side corners.', '2004-06-18 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(768771, 83492, 509, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur and smoke.  Off center framing works nicely here</td>', 'Love the motion blur and smoke.  Off center framing works nicely here', '2004-06-18 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(768774, 83285, 509, '<td valign="top">I''d actually prefer to see the true colors here.  The saturated sky draws a lot of emphasis here, while the strongest element of the shot is the caboose.</td>', 'I''d actually prefer to see the true colors here.  The saturated sky draws a lot of emphasis here, while the strongest element of the shot is the caboose.', '2004-06-18 16:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(768775, 82755, 509, '<td valign="top">Lol, nice challenge interpretation.</td>', 'Lol, nice challenge interpretation.', '2004-06-18 16:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(768776, 83546, 509, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see one of those operating up close.  Great subject.  Your composition nicely exemplifies the length of the engine as well</td>', 'I''d love to see one of those operating up close.  Great subject.  Your composition nicely exemplifies the length of the engine as well', '2004-06-18 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(768777, 82494, 509, '<td valign="top">Hmm...."old" doesn''t look too happy.  The man''s expression is a great capture.  If he was in sharp focus I  think this would be a really nice shot.</td>', 'Hmm...."old" doesn''t look too happy.  The man''s expression is a great capture.  If he was in sharp focus I  think this would be a really nice shot.', '2004-06-18 16:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(768778, 83594, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I think a tighter crop on the buses might work.  The empty space (curb along the road) doesn''t have much to add to the photo.  Good use of repetition and color</td>', 'Nice.  I think a tighter crop on the buses might work.  The empty space (curb along the road) doesn''t have much to add to the photo.  Good use of repetition and color', '2004-06-18 16:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(768784, 83380, 173, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, really keeps you looking at the photo trying to determine what is happening between the two characters. Great Job.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, really keeps you looking at the photo trying to determine what is happening between the two characters. Great Job.', '2004-06-18 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(768809, 82734, 21472, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2004-06-18 17:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(768867, 82298, 20856, '<td valign="top">What the crap is it?</td>', 'What the crap is it?', '2004-06-18 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(768869, 83173, 20856, '<td valign="top">contrast king</td>', 'contrast king', '2004-06-18 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(768887, 83604, 9668, '<td valign="top">This stands out, I like the blue against the red. Nice composition.</td>', 'This stands out, I like the blue against the red. Nice composition.', '2004-06-18 18:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(768893, 83349, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-06-18 18:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(768896, 83549, 6130, '<td valign="top">Just 10.</td>', 'Just 10.', '2004-06-18 18:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(768935, 83426, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the vignetting, but I think it might be a little intense. It''s encroaching on the car maybe a bit too much.</td>', 'I like the vignetting, but I think it might be a little intense. It''s encroaching on the car maybe a bit too much.', '2004-06-18 19:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(768938, 83523, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone a lot, but I''m not sure I would have burned the upper corners. I''m just not sure it adds anything, and it kind of pulls your focus.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone a lot, but I''m not sure I would have burned the upper corners. I''m just not sure it adds anything, and it kind of pulls your focus.', '2004-06-18 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(768944, 83475, 20395, '<td valign="top">I wish the light on this picture was a little better- the angle is really cool!</td>', 'I wish the light on this picture was a little better- the angle is really cool!', '2004-06-18 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(768956, 83601, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  A little soft.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  A little soft.', '2004-06-18 20:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(768958, 83536, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and handling.  FAding outside edge give is a feeloing of nostagia.</td>', 'Excellent exposure and handling.  FAding outside edge give is a feeloing of nostagia.', '2004-06-18 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(768960, 83380, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a very interesting image.</td>', 'It''s a very interesting image.', '2004-06-18 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(768962, 83456, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns in the reflections a lot, but the color seems a little strange. The white is very yellow.</td>', 'I like the patterns in the reflections a lot, but the color seems a little strange. The white is very yellow.', '2004-06-18 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(768964, 82368, 20395, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. It might be nice if the woman in the background was more in focus.</td>', 'Nice angle. It might be nice if the woman in the background was more in focus.', '2004-06-18 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(768970, 83210, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the color tones in the sky. I also like how you have sharpened it with out leaving any noticeable traces around the wings. Even if you have changed the sky''s color tones in post processing I do like the outcome, I hope you do well with this photo!</td>', 'I like the color tones in the sky. I also like how you have sharpened it with out leaving any noticeable traces around the wings. Even if you have changed the sky''s color tones in post processing I do like the outcome, I hope you do well with this photo!', '2004-06-18 20:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(768971, 83599, 5728, '<td valign="top">The pastel colors work in well with the sky. No oversharpening, good lighting, top shot!</td>', 'The pastel colors work in well with the sky. No oversharpening, good lighting, top shot!', '2004-06-18 20:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(768972, 83564, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing image, even with the power lines in the photo you have managed to make them fit in. The motion blur is so fitting, fantastic!</td>', 'Amazing image, even with the power lines in the photo you have managed to make them fit in. The motion blur is so fitting, fantastic!', '2004-06-18 20:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(768973, 83474, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphic - but difficult to grasp the train.</td>', 'Very graphic - but difficult to grasp the train.', '2004-06-18 20:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(768975, 83477, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, wonderful blue tones. The composition is very fitting, this will do well!</td>', 'Excellent shot, wonderful blue tones. The composition is very fitting, this will do well!', '2004-06-18 20:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(768979, 82752, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s an amazing cab!  The orange goes well with the green trees, but the tile roofs detract.  Black border - dunno.</td>', 'It''s an amazing cab!  The orange goes well with the green trees, but the tile roofs detract.  Black border - dunno.', '2004-06-18 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(768980, 83382, 19608, '<td valign="top">A fun parade - but I think you''ve included too much in the image.</td>', 'A fun parade - but I think you''ve included too much in the image.', '2004-06-18 20:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(768981, 83577, 20395, '<td valign="top">Cute! I wish the dog had been in focus instead of the driver- it would have heightened the chauffeur feel.</td>', 'Cute! I wish the dog had been in focus instead of the driver- it would have heightened the chauffeur feel.', '2004-06-18 20:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(768983, 82976, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white rendering in very contrasty lighting.  Not sure it shouts trains, planes, or airplanes - but it does whisper it.  Don''t think the thin white line in the border adds anything.</td>', 'Nice black and white rendering in very contrasty lighting.  Not sure it shouts trains, planes, or airplanes - but it does whisper it.  Don''t think the thin white line in the border adds anything.', '2004-06-18 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(768984, 83356, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent panning!</td>', 'Excellent panning!', '2004-06-18 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(768985, 83586, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''d want to park there too long.   Good find and use of the lighting.</td>', 'Not sure I''d want to park there too long.   Good find and use of the lighting.', '2004-06-18 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(769083, 83587, 18505, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Very effective composition.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Awesome!  Very effective composition.  One of my top picks.', '2004-06-18 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(769103, 83354, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, nice how it gives a sense of age (flowers in the engine, sunken tires, beaten up). I would like more of a blurred background (small apeture). Great job.</td>', 'Nice detail, nice how it gives a sense of age (flowers in the engine, sunken tires, beaten up). I would like more of a blurred background (small apeture). Great job.', '2004-06-18 23:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(769104, 83565, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like that it has both automobiles and and an airplane in it, yet the shot itself doen''t really stand out. Could probably be sharpened a bit more too.</td>', 'I like that it has both automobiles and and an airplane in it, yet the shot itself doen''t really stand out. Could probably be sharpened a bit more too.', '2004-06-18 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(769111, 83469, 9668, '<td valign="top">Smaller apeture woud have blurred the background a bit more, but then maybe you couldn''t of included the sign. Tap on the window is a bit annoying. Nice story behind it, although I have a hard time believing it''s top secret ;).</td>', 'Smaller apeture woud have blurred the background a bit more, but then maybe you couldn''t of included the sign. Tap on the window is a bit annoying. Nice story behind it, although I have a hard time believing it''s top secret ;).', '2004-06-18 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(769128, 83599, 22775, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the contest. The colors are perfect. Nice job.</td>', 'This was my favorite of the contest. The colors are perfect. Nice job.', '2004-06-18 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(769183, 82298, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very interesting abstract.  Colors are nice - but bright white spotd really detract.</td>', 'A very interesting abstract.  Colors are nice - but bright white spotd really detract.', '2004-06-19 01:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(769187, 83376, 19608, '<td valign="top">The right side of the car is SUPER fantastic.  So good in fact - that''s all you needed.  As unusual as it seems, I''d really like to see everything cropped out - bottom about 1/2 the wheesl, left crop right of the backup light, top at the top of the window frame, and right at the side view mirror.<br/> <br/>That''s not to say it''s not a great image already - it should score pretty high.</td>', 'The right side of the car is SUPER fantastic.  So good in fact - that''s all you needed.  As unusual as it seems, I''d really like to see everything cropped out - bottom about 1/2 the wheesl, left crop right of the backup light, top at the top of the window frame, and right at the side view mirror. That''s not to say it''s not a great image already - it should score pretty high.', '2004-06-19 01:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(769190, 83365, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and silhouette.  White in border draws too much attention.</td>', 'Nice composition and silhouette.  White in border draws too much attention.', '2004-06-19 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(769192, 83581, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice placement. The hint of clouds in the sky is very nice.  Plane is a bit hot.  Border does not work for my taste.</td>', 'Very nice placement. The hint of clouds in the sky is very nice.  Plane is a bit hot.  Border does not work for my taste.', '2004-06-19 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(769193, 83602, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual idea; nice exposure with both bright white and black runner in the frame.  It doesn''t have a strong message for me.</td>', 'Unusual idea; nice exposure with both bright white and black runner in the frame.  It doesn''t have a strong message for me.', '2004-06-19 01:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(769196, 83572, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice scene with a super sky.  The composition to emphasiize the sky was great choice.  But, the decision to include the black triangle at the bottom works aginst you.  I''d also like to see the yellow a bit brighter.</td>', 'A very nice scene with a super sky.  The composition to emphasiize the sky was great choice.  But, the decision to include the black triangle at the bottom works aginst you.  I''d also like to see the yellow a bit brighter.', '2004-06-19 01:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(769197, 83599, 19608, '<td valign="top">Love the colors; tehy work well with the sky.  Not excited about the gas cap being open with it''s shadow and dark area.</td>', 'Love the colors; tehy work well with the sky.  Not excited about the gas cap being open with it''s shadow and dark area.', '2004-06-19 01:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(769201, 83301, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautifulk car!  Try cropping out the yellow/black (text) in the top - think you will like it better.</td>', 'Beautifulk car!  Try cropping out the yellow/black (text) in the top - think you will like it better.', '2004-06-19 01:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(769203, 83532, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice rural capture.  Good composition (except that the wind sock is a bit close to the top of the frame.) Exposure spot on.</td>', 'Nice rural capture.  Good composition (except that the wind sock is a bit close to the top of the frame.) Exposure spot on.', '2004-06-19 01:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(769209, 83564, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition - would have quakified for deep DoF.  The moving train adds a unique perspective.  The building dome and the very dark area around it seem a bit too unreal for me.  Finally the telephone/electric wire are unfortunate.<br/>Your black and white work is good with srong crisp whites and deep blacks.</td>', 'Stunning composition - would have quakified for deep DoF.  The moving train adds a unique perspective.  The building dome and the very dark area around it seem a bit too unreal for me.  Finally the telephone/electric wire are unfortunate.Your black and white work is good with srong crisp whites and deep blacks.', '2004-06-19 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(769210, 82812, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition and execution.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition and execution.', '2004-06-19 01:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(769214, 82809, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  The street and the car below are exceptionally graphic and well done.  But, the wing flaps (I know you were going for bith airplanes and autos) take up too much of the image.  I hope you tried the same shot with less  wing.  <br/> <br/>Even with the wing flaps as is, it''s a very strong and graphic submission.</td>', 'Stunning image.  The street and the car below are exceptionally graphic and well done.  But, the wing flaps (I know you were going for bith airplanes and autos) take up too much of the image.  I hope you tried the same shot with less  wing.   Even with the wing flaps as is, it''s a very strong and graphic submission.', '2004-06-19 01:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(769216, 83577, 19608, '<td valign="top">Idea is superb - and a very nice dog.  This is one case where I would suggest you open up, blur the background.  As is, there''s too much busy detail in the background.</td>', 'Idea is superb - and a very nice dog.  This is one case where I would suggest you open up, blur the background.  As is, there''s too much busy detail in the background.', '2004-06-19 01:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
