(769378, 83284, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pointless title related to this shot in my view. It could be perceived that you''re trying to tie votes to an emotive event. I feel that the treatment of the plane does little for the shot and may be an attempt to make something interesting of a scene with not much going on!</td>', 'Pointless title related to this shot in my view. It could be perceived that you''re trying to tie votes to an emotive event. I feel that the treatment of the plane does little for the shot and may be an attempt to make something interesting of a scene with not much going on!', '2004-06-19 07:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(769379, 83564, 1009, '<td valign="top">I love the motion blur of this one, unless the train was moving VERY slow and you used a slow shutter speed you chose a very dangerous place to capture a great photo. The sky is also fantastic, as is the sharpness, and DOF. I''m rating this one an 8, I think I''ve only rated half a dozen photos so high in the 2 years I''ve been voting on this site. Great, great job!</td>', 'I love the motion blur of this one, unless the train was moving VERY slow and you used a slow shutter speed you chose a very dangerous place to capture a great photo. The sky is also fantastic, as is the sharpness, and DOF. I''m rating this one an 8, I think I''ve only rated half a dozen photos so high in the 2 years I''ve been voting on this site. Great, great job!', '2004-06-19 07:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(769380, 83493, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice semi stop motion, looks like good panning to me. Good job...</td>', 'Very nice semi stop motion, looks like good panning to me. Good job...', '2004-06-19 07:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
