(769418, 83546, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the engine. I wish you had a closer up view where we could see all its gears and stuff... nice texture.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the engine. I wish you had a closer up view where we could see all its gears and stuff... nice texture.', '2004-06-19 07:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
