(769881, 83614, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice job on a unique angle and a fine photograph. I like sky and the razorwire contrast, also the framing is nice. Good job...</td>', 'Nice job on a unique angle and a fine photograph. I like sky and the razorwire contrast, also the framing is nice. Good job...', '2004-06-20 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
