(769930, 83356, 4411, '<td valign="top">Superb job on the panning. Not much more I can say about this - it''s a cracking motorsport shot.</td>', 'Superb job on the panning. Not much more I can say about this - it''s a cracking motorsport shot.', '2004-06-20 07:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(769936, 83429, 16970, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that this is over sharpened cos this could be a 10.  The plane is great and the sky is fantastic but over sharpened.  There is a halo around the point.  (6)</td>', 'It''s a shame that this is over sharpened cos this could be a 10.  The plane is great and the sky is fantastic but over sharpened.  There is a halo around the point.  (6)', '2004-06-20 07:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(770015, 83576, 10402, '<td valign="top">I love the low contrast "faded" look. I don''t like the distracting border.</td>', 'I love the low contrast "faded" look. I don''t like the distracting border.', '2004-06-20 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(770018, 82512, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot. This should be on a poster.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot. This should be on a poster.', '2004-06-20 10:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(770019, 83555, 10402, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is a funny car. The centered composition and head-on point of view work perfectly.</td>', 'Yes, it is a funny car. The centered composition and head-on point of view work perfectly.', '2004-06-20 10:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(770020, 83456, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The lighting seems a bit dark, but that''s the only tiny thing I would nitpick about. This is an absolutely beautiful picture.</td>', 'Great shot! The lighting seems a bit dark, but that''s the only tiny thing I would nitpick about. This is an absolutely beautiful picture.', '2004-06-20 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(770021, 83557, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot! How''d you get the cop to hang around while you set it up? ;-) Great job!</td>', 'Really nice shot! How''d you get the cop to hang around while you set it up? ;-) Great job!', '2004-06-20 10:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(770024, 83590, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I love the reflection. The power poles are rather distracting; moving a meter or two to the left would have avoided the largest one, although I don''t know if that was possible or what would have been included on the right. The compression artifacts could have been avoided by using a higher quality JPEG setting.</td>', 'Nice subject. I love the reflection. The power poles are rather distracting; moving a meter or two to the left would have avoided the largest one, although I don''t know if that was possible or what would have been included on the right. The compression artifacts could have been avoided by using a higher quality JPEG setting.', '2004-06-20 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(770028, 83133, 10402, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of a gloomy day; perfect for working late. A blue sky might have provided better lighting, but then the car would probably be gone and it wouldn''t meet the challenge!<br/> <br/>But seriously, this is an interesting building and I like the point of view.</td>', 'Seems kind of a gloomy day; perfect for working late. A blue sky might have provided better lighting, but then the car would probably be gone and it wouldn''t meet the challenge! But seriously, this is an interesting building and I like the point of view.', '2004-06-20 11:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(770032, 83442, 10402, '<td valign="top">A creative approach, with just enough detail to identify the subject, and some nice soft diagonal lines to add excitement.</td>', 'A creative approach, with just enough detail to identify the subject, and some nice soft diagonal lines to add excitement.', '2004-06-20 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(770043, 83241, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, with a nice combination of smooth and jagged shapes. I''d prefer it a bit brighter, although that does change the overall feeling so may not convey the message you want it to. But the title seems to be a reference to the sixties culture, and pop art of that period used a generally bright palette.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, with a nice combination of smooth and jagged shapes. I''d prefer it a bit brighter, although that does change the overall feeling so may not convey the message you want it to. But the title seems to be a reference to the sixties culture, and pop art of that period used a generally bright palette.', '2004-06-20 11:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(770051, 82368, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much motion blur here. The character of the train is completely obscured.</td>', 'I think there is too much motion blur here. The character of the train is completely obscured.', '2004-06-20 11:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(770052, 83134, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective, but I think waiting for the train to get a little closer would have made a more interesting photo.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective, but I think waiting for the train to get a little closer would have made a more interesting photo.', '2004-06-20 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(770056, 83525, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great colors here. Nice shapes too. The sky is OK, but darker and bluer would have been nicer; a polarizer might have helped achieve this.</td>', 'Great colors here. Nice shapes too. The sky is OK, but darker and bluer would have been nicer; a polarizer might have helped achieve this.', '2004-06-20 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(770075, 83536, 15403, '<td valign="top">This is a truly beautiful piece of art.  Thanks for sharing it!</td>', 'This is a truly beautiful piece of art.  Thanks for sharing it!', '2004-06-20 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(770077, 83523, 15403, '<td valign="top">the sepia/duotone works beautifully here</td>', 'the sepia/duotone works beautifully here', '2004-06-20 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(770102, 83539, 23267, '<td valign="top">So much and so little happening at the same time.  This is great composition and great lighting rolled together.  Outstanding.</td>', 'So much and so little happening at the same time.  This is great composition and great lighting rolled together.  Outstanding.', '2004-06-20 12:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(770123, 83365, 19358, '<td valign="top">A very unusual view, yet striking.  It gives the feeling of danger of the things yet<br/>to come.</td>', 'A very unusual view, yet striking.  It gives the feeling of danger of the things yetto come.', '2004-06-20 13:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(770126, 83577, 19358, '<td valign="top">Too bad it did not have gerater depth of field.</td>', 'Too bad it did not have gerater depth of field.', '2004-06-20 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(770127, 83495, 19358, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling.   A great shot, nice lighting.  Took a lot time in setting up.<br/>Really good effort.</td>', 'I know the feeling.   A great shot, nice lighting.  Took a lot time in setting up.Really good effort.', '2004-06-20 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(770131, 83570, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-06-20 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
