(770177, 83429, 21217, '<td valign="top">I like the lightness,  the crop tand the simply colors. Nice photo. My favourite in this challenge. I hope you win the ribon.</td>', 'I like the lightness,  the crop tand the simply colors. Nice photo. My favourite in this challenge. I hope you win the ribon.', '2004-06-20 15:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(770220, 83434, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wonderful,  imaginative and well done shot.  Great job, and good luck !</td>', 'Wonderful,  imaginative and well done shot.  Great job, and good luck !', '2004-06-20 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(770225, 83475, 23279, '<td valign="top">I used to work at an airport, and that picture is a beauty.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I used to work at an airport, and that picture is a beauty.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-06-20 17:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(770235, 83066, 4411, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Great blur on the shot and a top job in post-processing.</td>', 'Sweet. Great blur on the shot and a top job in post-processing.', '2004-06-20 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(770243, 83572, 6999, '<td valign="top">De-sat is effective, and hasn''t harmed the effect of light in the sky too much, though perhaps some work to darken the (formerly) blue areas might have paid off? Like the composition very much, but would wish for a little more impact from the yellow of the buses - they all seem a touch muted to me. 6</td>', 'De-sat is effective, and hasn''t harmed the effect of light in the sky too much, though perhaps some work to darken the (formerly) blue areas might have paid off? Like the composition very much, but would wish for a little more impact from the yellow of the buses - they all seem a touch muted to me. 6', '2004-06-20 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(770245, 83525, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nie and bright, but the composition doesn''t work for me: I don''t find this particular conjunction of trains terribly interesting - in fact I want to focus on the yellow against the red of the further wagon, and the geometry of those hand rails. The bits of background visible beneath, and the weeds in front also confuse the focus of attention, I think. Rendering of the red and yellow is very strong though. 5</td>', 'Nie and bright, but the composition doesn''t work for me: I don''t find this particular conjunction of trains terribly interesting - in fact I want to focus on the yellow against the red of the further wagon, and the geometry of those hand rails. The bits of background visible beneath, and the weeds in front also confuse the focus of attention, I think. Rendering of the red and yellow is very strong though. 5', '2004-06-20 18:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(770247, 83526, 6999, '<td valign="top">Focus is really bizarre in this - have you softened it? Like the leading lines effect, though the solidity of the water tower pulls the eye quite strongly too - in fact might form an intersting balance t the primary compositional elements of the rails and the engine. Burnt out sky, and those poles and posts seem cluttered rather than evocative. 4</td>', 'Focus is really bizarre in this - have you softened it? Like the leading lines effect, though the solidity of the water tower pulls the eye quite strongly too - in fact might form an intersting balance t the primary compositional elements of the rails and the engine. Burnt out sky, and those poles and posts seem cluttered rather than evocative. 4', '2004-06-20 18:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(770248, 83349, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well balanced composition, and a neat idea. Lacks jjust that touch of punch - perhaps either a faster or slower shutter would have either frozen the water or blurred it more completely? This seems to fall rather halfway, to me. Would love to see it really fast, freezing that action :-) 6</td>', 'Well balanced composition, and a neat idea. Lacks jjust that touch of punch - perhaps either a faster or slower shutter would have either frozen the water or blurred it more completely? This seems to fall rather halfway, to me. Would love to see it really fast, freezing that action :-) 6', '2004-06-20 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(770250, 82751, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, proper grown-up light - I like this. Brings out the almost scuptural engineering of the beast. Wonderfully well done technically. Cropping bother a touch - why not simply glory in the definition of the metal, and plonk the old thing full frame? The angle of view you''ve chosen, and the complementary angles of the front of the train and the top would place the front of the engine right on the happy thirds line, and also might rid the shot of the slight feeling that you''ve cropped to hide something at the back of it. That visible background frame left, for me, adds nothing here - let it impose itself on us! But great work - great detail, great tonality, and great subject - real feeling of power. 8</td>', 'Ah, proper grown-up light - I like this. Brings out the almost scuptural engineering of the beast. Wonderfully well done technically. Cropping bother a touch - why not simply glory in the definition of the metal, and plonk the old thing full frame? The angle of view you''ve chosen, and the complementary angles of the front of the train and the top would place the front of the engine right on the happy thirds line, and also might rid the shot of the slight feeling that you''ve cropped to hide something at the back of it. That visible background frame left, for me, adds nothing here - let it impose itself on us! But great work - great detail, great tonality, and great subject - real feeling of power. 8', '2004-06-20 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(770252, 82256, 6999, '<td valign="top">Confused composition - trees, odd positioning in frame of the two primary subjects, overlapping of subjects, profusion of geometry with the square architecture, and the more organic train, the blocky currves of the plane, the more modern curves of the other train, and then the trees - all makes it difficult to get into this image. Looks like not a good day for light, either: very very general, very blank illumination on everything, nothing to bring the eye to a primary focus anywhere. 4</td>', 'Confused composition - trees, odd positioning in frame of the two primary subjects, overlapping of subjects, profusion of geometry with the square architecture, and the more organic train, the blocky currves of the plane, the more modern curves of the other train, and then the trees - all makes it difficult to get into this image. Looks like not a good day for light, either: very very general, very blank illumination on everything, nothing to bring the eye to a primary focus anywhere. 4', '2004-06-20 19:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(770256, 82810, 6999, '<td valign="top">My immediate feeling on seeing this, is that somewhere around this subject there''s a wonderful shot waiting to get out, but that this looks like the kind of thing taken to remind one of the situation, in order to go back later. The contrast of life and death, rust and green, is tempting, but this for me is too obvious, too straightforward. Get personal with it - get low daown and try and create weird landscapes across the rusted car, with the greenery forming an horizon, or a foreground, or concentrate on the strange angles around that exposed subframe ... there must be magical images here :-) <br/> <br/>The composition is what mostly makes this look like a reminder shot: positioning of the car in frame seems arbitrary, from centre bottom to mid centre top - it doesn''t lead me anywhere, doesn''t point up the contrast of metal and plants. 5</td>', 'My immediate feeling on seeing this, is that somewhere around this subject there''s a wonderful shot waiting to get out, but that this looks like the kind of thing taken to remind one of the situation, in order to go back later. The contrast of life and death, rust and green, is tempting, but this for me is too obvious, too straightforward. Get personal with it - get low daown and try and create weird landscapes across the rusted car, with the greenery forming an horizon, or a foreground, or concentrate on the strange angles around that exposed subframe ... there must be magical images here :-)  The composition is what mostly makes this look like a reminder shot: positioning of the car in frame seems arbitrary, from centre bottom to mid centre top - it doesn''t lead me anywhere, doesn''t point up the contrast of metal and plants. 5', '2004-06-20 19:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(770269, 83431, 8860, '<td valign="top">A surprisingly interesting shot. Very good double take thing hits you first off. Could have cleaned the image up a bit more but this is nice.</td>', 'A surprisingly interesting shot. Very good double take thing hits you first off. Could have cleaned the image up a bit more but this is nice.', '2004-06-20 19:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(770270, 82812, 6999, '<td valign="top">The obvious, brief-glance comment would be to moan about he centred composition ... but of course this is <i>not</i> centred. The cleanliness of the aircraft, and the dissipation of the contrail into a murky brown that speaks of pollution, especially against the deepest blue suffusion of the sky brings the political to this image; some suggestion of the battle of the giant airlines against the perception of their trade as damaging to our world - everything must be shiny bright, but leaves a trail of waste and poisons. The bluntness of the placing of the plane in frame adds to this effect beautifully, disrupting that almost complete darkness. 9</td>', 'The obvious, brief-glance comment would be to moan about he centred composition ... but of course this is not centred. The cleanliness of the aircraft, and the dissipation of the contrail into a murky brown that speaks of pollution, especially against the deepest blue suffusion of the sky brings the political to this image; some suggestion of the battle of the giant airlines against the perception of their trade as damaging to our world - everything must be shiny bright, but leaves a trail of waste and poisons. The bluntness of the placing of the plane in frame adds to this effect beautifully, disrupting that almost complete darkness. 9', '2004-06-20 19:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(770271, 82256, 8860, '<td valign="top">I also see an automobile - full house!</td>', 'I also see an automobile - full house!', '2004-06-20 19:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(770274, 83209, 8860, '<td valign="top">Never seen this vehicle apart from on TV''s "World''s Worst Behaved Tornados Caught on Candid Camera Being Framed With Crazy Animals and Dumb Criminals in Police Chases Ever, 136" show or something.  <br/> <br/>Like the tones.</td>', 'Never seen this vehicle apart from on TV''s "World''s Worst Behaved Tornados Caught on Candid Camera Being Framed With Crazy Animals and Dumb Criminals in Police Chases Ever, 136" show or something.   Like the tones.', '2004-06-20 19:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(770276, 82494, 8860, '<td valign="top">Less skewed and longer DOF would be good. A nice take on the challenge and good not to get anyone looking at camera too obviously - although with that guy''s eyes it''s difficult to tell!!</td>', 'Less skewed and longer DOF would be good. A nice take on the challenge and good not to get anyone looking at camera too obviously - although with that guy''s eyes it''s difficult to tell!!', '2004-06-20 19:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(770277, 83582, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great lighting but you could use a tripod. Love the reflective tracks.</td>', 'Great lighting but you could use a tripod. Love the reflective tracks.', '2004-06-20 20:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(770279, 83477, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely crisp smoke trail, rich colours and great composition. This may ribbon or at least be on front page.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-21 02:06:29.</i></td>', 'Lovely crisp smoke trail, rich colours and great composition. This may ribbon or at least be on front page.', '2004-06-20 20:02:36.000000', '2004-06-21 03:06:29.000000', 1),
(770280, 83475, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dramatic angle but this lacks some post-processing. Tones and colour are muted and, if intentional, should have been pushed more emphatically.</td>', 'Dramatic angle but this lacks some post-processing. Tones and colour are muted and, if intentional, should have been pushed more emphatically.', '2004-06-20 20:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(770285, 82512, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''ll eat my head if this hasn''t got a blue gif attached afterwards. It''s expertly taken with some nice use of ND filter(?) and an incredible POV. Superb and virtually flawless with strong colours which I find very exciting. Could be a front cover of a motoring mag for sure. My untouchable [10]<br/> <br/>In fact, I''ve now decided that this is one of the best car pictures I''ve ever seen and would have been well chuffed to have shot it myself. You may have gone to effort with the apparatus but since this is a marketable shot I think it was well worth it.</td>', 'I''ll eat my head if this hasn''t got a blue gif attached afterwards. It''s expertly taken with some nice use of ND filter(?) and an incredible POV. Superb and virtually flawless with strong colours which I find very exciting. Could be a front cover of a motoring mag for sure. My untouchable [10] In fact, I''ve now decided that this is one of the best car pictures I''ve ever seen and would have been well chuffed to have shot it myself. You may have gone to effort with the apparatus but since this is a marketable shot I think it was well worth it.', '2004-06-20 20:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
