(770559, 82298, 10055, '<td valign="top">I gave you the ten for being creative and "thinking out side a box".....next time....stand back and shoot, it works for this site....good luck....be creative and just add it to your portfolio to show off...being "artsy" isn''t a  favorite thing around here...I have done the same and got burned...however, there are a few that enjoy such work of looking at things differently...I am one of them....hope you do much better next time..:)</td>', 'I gave you the ten for being creative and "thinking out side a box".....next time....stand back and shoot, it works for this site....good luck....be creative and just add it to your portfolio to show off...being "artsy" isn''t a  favorite thing around here...I have done the same and got burned...however, there are a few that enjoy such work of looking at things differently...I am one of them....hope you do much better next time..:)', '2004-06-21 01:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
