(771203, 83379, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, much appreciated. I was out taking photos and whilst waiting for my wife to pick me up I thought that I would set up my kit so that I could get a shot of cars coming down the road. The first car that turned up was my wife''s! So that was it really, converted to b&amp;w, adjusted contrast and that was that. Did not expect to do much with it but pleased some people liked it. Thanks again.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-29 14:32:59.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, much appreciated. I was out taking photos and whilst waiting for my wife to pick me up I thought that I would set up my kit so that I could get a shot of cars coming down the road. The first car that turned up was my wife''s! So that was it really, converted to b&w, adjusted contrast and that was that. Did not expect to do much with it but pleased some people liked it. Thanks again. Mike', '2004-06-21 09:13:45.000000', '2004-06-29 15:32:59.000000', 0),
