(773943, 82368, 8860, '<td valign="top">Heidar - you might be interested in this shot of mine which was taken on the London Underground also. It seems we both wanted a similar effect here.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=41712" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/41712.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/41712.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/41712.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Heidar - you might be interested in this shot of mine which was taken on the London Underground also. It seems we both wanted a similar effect here.', '2004-06-22 19:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
